(4854511, 705023, 85097, '<td valign="top">the key to doing these types of photos is to make sure the glasses are SUPER clean, no dust specks or finger prints.  Try lighting from behind to prevent the glare on the glass.  your horizon is a little bit tilted, try using PS to straiten that as well.  the colors here are nice, but the reflection is distracting.  the glasses are lined up nice.</td>', 'the key to doing these types of photos is to make sure the glasses are SUPER clean, no dust specks or finger prints.  Try lighting from behind to prevent the glare on the glass.  your horizon is a little bit tilted, try using PS to straiten that as well.  the colors here are nice, but the reflection is distracting.  the glasses are lined up nice.', '2008-08-01 01:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
