(4854850, 705410, 5354, '<td valign="top">Love em or hate em! , well I certainly don''t love em.<br/>There are many many cat shots here on DPC, the ones which stand out are usually created using extraordinary lighting or depth of field. Unfortunately this comes across as a very simple record shot. The blue eyes do help, but they are not enough in this case.</td>', 'Love em or hate em! , well I certainly don''t love em.There are many many cat shots here on DPC, the ones which stand out are usually created using extraordinary lighting or depth of field. Unfortunately this comes across as a very simple record shot. The blue eyes do help, but they are not enough in this case.', '2008-08-01 04:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854851, 703617, 14867, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and rather fascinating subject.<br/>The image is globally very dark though. The good point is that it emphasizes the contrast, but the image is still contrasted enough, and more attractive, after a simple level''s adjustement.</td>', 'Good composition, and rather fascinating subject.The image is globally very dark though. The good point is that it emphasizes the contrast, but the image is still contrasted enough, and more attractive, after a simple level''s adjustement.', '2008-08-01 04:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854852, 699208, 5354, '<td valign="top">Way too dark, all I can see on my calibrated monitor is row on row of yellow balls (lights). There is little or no detail in the shadows</td>', 'Way too dark, all I can see on my calibrated monitor is row on row of yellow balls (lights). There is little or no detail in the shadows', '2008-08-01 04:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854857, 705212, 14867, '<td valign="top">The birds are too little for an interesting image. The lighting is a bit flat too.<br/>A shame the first bird isn''t completely reflected.</td>', 'The birds are too little for an interesting image. The lighting is a bit flat too.A shame the first bird isn''t completely reflected.', '2008-08-01 04:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854861, 704831, 5354, '<td valign="top">Lots of classic mistakes evident in this shot. The subjects are all looking straight into the camera, and because of that the viewer doesn''t get any feeling of ''action'' or sense of fun. 3 on the raft and one diving/jumping in or splashing each other and obviously laughing might bring this image to life.<br/>At the moment it''s a record shot of some kids in the rain, nothing exciting to be an honest viewer.</td>', 'Lots of classic mistakes evident in this shot. The subjects are all looking straight into the camera, and because of that the viewer doesn''t get any feeling of ''action'' or sense of fun. 3 on the raft and one diving/jumping in or splashing each other and obviously laughing might bring this image to life.At the moment it''s a record shot of some kids in the rain, nothing exciting to be an honest viewer.', '2008-08-01 04:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854866, 698751, 5354, '<td valign="top">If you are going to produce a landscape then absolutely everything from the first pebble at your feet to the last tree on the horizon needs to be in focus.  In this image we don''t get sharp until 6/8 feet from the foreground, and thats a shame. Use f22 and focus on something 3 feet out, that way the hyperfocal point will ensure you have the maximum depth of field.<br/> <br/>This image has a strong foreground element but you waste it by making it out of focus.  It then needs something in the distance to lead the eye to.</td>', 'If you are going to produce a landscape then absolutely everything from the first pebble at your feet to the last tree on the horizon needs to be in focus.  In this image we don''t get sharp until 6/8 feet from the foreground, and thats a shame. Use f22 and focus on something 3 feet out, that way the hyperfocal point will ensure you have the maximum depth of field. This image has a strong foreground element but you waste it by making it out of focus.  It then needs something in the distance to lead the eye to.', '2008-08-01 04:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854871, 705212, 5354, '<td valign="top">If you are going to shoot birds then you need to fill the frame. These two are insignificant elements in the composition and so the viewer doesn''t really get a chance to see the detail. <br/> <br/>As a pictorial image there is nothing really for the viewer either, so this image doesn''t provide interest in sufficient detail or as a landscape.</td>', 'If you are going to shoot birds then you need to fill the frame. These two are insignificant elements in the composition and so the viewer doesn''t really get a chance to see the detail.  As a pictorial image there is nothing really for the viewer either, so this image doesn''t provide interest in sufficient detail or as a landscape.', '2008-08-01 04:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854875, 705307, 5354, '<td valign="top">Lots of wasted space on the left, with the background being too dark this is overpowering. I keep peering into that darkness to try and find something else after I''ve looked at the sharp flower.</td>', 'Lots of wasted space on the left, with the background being too dark this is overpowering. I keep peering into that darkness to try and find something else after I''ve looked at the sharp flower.', '2008-08-01 04:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
