(4854877, 705231, 56502, '<td valign="top">I personally find the soft-focus effect around her nose/mouth/cheeks a bit overdone, but nevertheless a really beautiful, great shot.</td>', 'I personally find the soft-focus effect around her nose/mouth/cheeks a bit overdone, but nevertheless a really beautiful, great shot.', '2008-08-01 04:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854935, 705023, 95596, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but I see room from improvements: the photo is slightly tilted (without any apparent reason), the burst of light on the left is quite annoying, and the glasses seems to be a bit dirty.</td>', 'I like the concept, but I see room from improvements: the photo is slightly tilted (without any apparent reason), the burst of light on the left is quite annoying, and the glasses seems to be a bit dirty.', '2008-08-01 05:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854936, 703856, 51167, '<td valign="top">How early was the baby?  My daughter was born 7 weeks premature and didn''t have her lungs fully developed yet.  She was on CPAP at first.  It''s something that is hard to go through, she was our first and we had no clue there was any complications until she came early.</td>', 'How early was the baby?  My daughter was born 7 weeks premature and didn''t have her lungs fully developed yet.  She was on CPAP at first.  It''s something that is hard to go through, she was our first and we had no clue there was any complications until she came early.', '2008-08-01 05:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4854938, 704652, 57421, '<td valign="top">The dragonfly is too small / not detailed enough. Beyond closer crop/zoom, you should also be aware that the hard light reduces the details as the top of the dragonfly is strongly lit, while below it appears very dark due to strong contrast. For what it''s worth, here is a "best in class" example with a similar dragonfly. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=514705" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/684/120/514705.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/684/120/514705.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/684/120/514705.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The dragonfly is too small / not detailed enough. Beyond closer crop/zoom, you should also be aware that the hard light reduces the details as the top of the dragonfly is strongly lit, while below it appears very dark due to strong contrast. For what it''s worth, here is a "best in class" example with a similar dragonfly. ', '2008-08-01 05:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
