(4855146, 703902, 65035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful processing. I love the purple tones in the desat, I''ve not seen that before, it''s lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful processing. I love the purple tones in the desat, I''ve not seen that before, it''s lovely.', '2008-08-01 07:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855147, 704492, 3306, '<td valign="top">The photograph speaks for itself. The border was unnecessary.</td>', 'The photograph speaks for itself. The border was unnecessary.', '2008-08-01 07:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855148, 700180, 7786, '<td valign="top">A very interesting photograph, sharp and detailed. This image has many strong points, the leading lines of the submerged leaf all point to those huge bright eyes. I would have croped it tighter though. The grean leafs appearing at the top and bottom are distracting and the back part of the frog does not add any interest to the image. If the interesting face would have filled more of the frame this would have been a top image in this challenge. But overall a good image.</td>', 'A very interesting photograph, sharp and detailed. This image has many strong points, the leading lines of the submerged leaf all point to those huge bright eyes. I would have croped it tighter though. The grean leafs appearing at the top and bottom are distracting and the back part of the frog does not add any interest to the image. If the interesting face would have filled more of the frame this would have been a top image in this challenge. But overall a good image.', '2008-08-01 07:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855151, 705258, 96574, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2008-08-01 07:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855153, 705194, 7786, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset image and well composed. A tighter crop would have been better IMO as the top blue part does not add much interest to an otherwise beautiful scene.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset image and well composed. A tighter crop would have been better IMO as the top blue part does not add much interest to an otherwise beautiful scene.', '2008-08-01 07:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
