(4855244, 704478, 56002, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I think you will get  a lot of comments about the location of the sunburst, but it is a charming photograph.</td>', 'I like this.  I think you will get  a lot of comments about the location of the sunburst, but it is a charming photograph.', '2008-08-01 08:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
