(4855498, 697673, 30982, '<td valign="top">This looks to be a beautiful photograph but probably overprocessed for the DPC crowd - it''s leaning more toward "digital art" than photography.  That said, I kinda like how the background is rendered but would prefer a bit more natural clarity on her face, particularly the one dark eye.  She''s a beautiful model.</td>', 'This looks to be a beautiful photograph but probably overprocessed for the DPC crowd - it''s leaning more toward "digital art" than photography.  That said, I kinda like how the background is rendered but would prefer a bit more natural clarity on her face, particularly the one dark eye.  She''s a beautiful model.', '2008-08-01 10:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855515, 705018, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting facility to photograph - I find it intriguing how healthy the trees are and how abandonned it looks (and is, I''m quite sure.)  The light is rather flat which renders the photograph a bit dull - not much you can do about it other than to wait for better light.  The composition seems somewhat unstructured, though I''m also not sure how to recommend a better composition.  I wonder if this might have a bit more impact in B&amp;W with some additional contrast added.</td>', 'An interesting facility to photograph - I find it intriguing how healthy the trees are and how abandonned it looks (and is, I''m quite sure.)  The light is rather flat which renders the photograph a bit dull - not much you can do about it other than to wait for better light.  The composition seems somewhat unstructured, though I''m also not sure how to recommend a better composition.  I wonder if this might have a bit more impact in B&W with some additional contrast added.', '2008-08-01 10:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4855522, 705258, 24913, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would give a more impactful image. Nice capture though</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would give a more impactful image. Nice capture though', '2008-08-01 10:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
