(4855550, 705224, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good sunset pic with nice reflection of the gold at the water''s edge.  Lacks a "DPC Wow!" factor for a high score.  The water could use a bit more crispness, though I''m not sure how to tell you to get that.  Perhaps a faster ISO so you can use a narrower aperture with a shutter speed that would still stop the water''s motion.  Your best bet is to ask after the challenge if you want more info - lots of the landscape photogs would probably be glad to help you out.</td>', 'A good sunset pic with nice reflection of the gold at the water''s edge.  Lacks a "DPC Wow!" factor for a high score.  The water could use a bit more crispness, though I''m not sure how to tell you to get that.  Perhaps a faster ISO so you can use a narrower aperture with a shutter speed that would still stop the water''s motion.  Your best bet is to ask after the challenge if you want more info - lots of the landscape photogs would probably be glad to help you out.', '2008-08-01 10:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
