(4855600, 704038, 30982, '<td valign="top">To me a very interesting shot.  I love the door that appears to be simply cut out and stuck in place.  The guitar is an added bonus.  I think this shot might benefit from a levels adjustment or an increase in brightness, and a curves or contrast adjustment to bring out the contrast more.  Try that and see what you think.</td>', 'To me a very interesting shot.  I love the door that appears to be simply cut out and stuck in place.  The guitar is an added bonus.  I think this shot might benefit from a levels adjustment or an increase in brightness, and a curves or contrast adjustment to bring out the contrast more.  Try that and see what you think.', '2008-08-01 11:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
