(4855633, 705401, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s that time around here, too.  Lovely vistas of grain and freshly harvested fields.  A good basic landscape.  Good use of the road as a leading line and the colors are natural and not overdone.  As far as landscapes on DPC, it may be a bit plain, and the composition is a bit static with the horizon at the halfway point.</td>', 'It''s that time around here, too.  Lovely vistas of grain and freshly harvested fields.  A good basic landscape.  Good use of the road as a leading line and the colors are natural and not overdone.  As far as landscapes on DPC, it may be a bit plain, and the composition is a bit static with the horizon at the halfway point.', '2008-08-01 11:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
