(4856742, 705153, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the grit of this.  I can''t help but want the other foot, or at least part of the other foot, to give him balance.  Very cool car in the front, by the way.</td>', 'I like the grit of this.  I can''t help but want the other foot, or at least part of the other foot, to give him balance.  Very cool car in the front, by the way.', '2008-08-01 15:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
