(4856751, 705375, 73056, '<td valign="top">This is really a nice shot, I just wish it were brighter - very gray and flat on my computer. I''d experiment with curves, levels, contrast/brightening if it were my image. MHO.</td>', 'This is really a nice shot, I just wish it were brighter - very gray and flat on my computer. I''d experiment with curves, levels, contrast/brightening if it were my image. MHO.', '2008-08-01 15:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4856757, 705337, 30982, '<td valign="top">Took me a second after reading your title to see what this shows me.  Very impressive horse and talented rider!  Technicals may hurt you a bit (as will the fast voter, who may miss the novelty of this).  Under advanced, you could have cloned out the telephone pole, but it ain''t easy to do.</td>', 'Took me a second after reading your title to see what this shows me.  Very impressive horse and talented rider!  Technicals may hurt you a bit (as will the fast voter, who may miss the novelty of this).  Under advanced, you could have cloned out the telephone pole, but it ain''t easy to do.', '2008-08-01 15:56:28.000000', NULL, 1);
