(4857222, 704529, 16912, '<td valign="top">ok, you got me good with this! a part of me says your mad and actualy sitting in a clever set but the slight motion blur makes me think its a jump (and one of many lol). Why is the lamp stand there? its not turned on, not required however seems to work. Best of luck and hope your creativity pays dividends, its a solid nine from me.</td>', 'ok, you got me good with this! a part of me says your mad and actualy sitting in a clever set but the slight motion blur makes me think its a jump (and one of many lol). Why is the lamp stand there? its not turned on, not required however seems to work. Best of luck and hope your creativity pays dividends, its a solid nine from me.', '2008-08-01 18:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
