(4858179, 705173, 81362, '<td valign="top">The swing is sharp, well exposed, and very interesting. The composition would have been stroger with less background on the left and a little more on the right, maybe shifting to hide or reduce the impact of the horizontal line where the wall joins the sidewalk.</td>', 'The swing is sharp, well exposed, and very interesting. The composition would have been stroger with less background on the left and a little more on the right, maybe shifting to hide or reduce the impact of the horizontal line where the wall joins the sidewalk.', '2008-08-02 01:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
