(4859180, 704786, 15291, '<td valign="top">Love the composition &amp; natural look of the image.</td>', 'Love the composition & natural look of the image.', '2008-08-02 12:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859181, 699002, 15291, '<td valign="top">They don''t get much better then this, strong all around image increible detail.</td>', 'They don''t get much better then this, strong all around image increible detail.', '2008-08-02 12:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859183, 699571, 15291, '<td valign="top">Simply awesome capture, the red flower really set off the mantis, the detail is fantastic.</td>', 'Simply awesome capture, the red flower really set off the mantis, the detail is fantastic.', '2008-08-02 12:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859184, 703165, 15291, '<td valign="top">What can you say about perfection, awesome capture ! 9</td>', 'What can you say about perfection, awesome capture ! 9', '2008-08-02 12:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859197, 698839, 58452, '<td valign="top">It''s simply not safe for me to properly comment on this image.  :) Is this a SP???  Looks like a release in the models left hand. Certainly an interesting way to light a nude. I wish just a bit of snooted light had kissed the face.  The hard shadow straight down the center of the nose and smile just doesn''t do anything for me.  Otherwise very nice.</td>', 'It''s simply not safe for me to properly comment on this image.  :) Is this a SP???  Looks like a release in the models left hand. Certainly an interesting way to light a nude. I wish just a bit of snooted light had kissed the face.  The hard shadow straight down the center of the nose and smile just doesn''t do anything for me.  Otherwise very nice.', '2008-08-02 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859200, 700087, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, the detail &amp; composition are well done.</td>', 'Nice capture, the detail & composition are well done.', '2008-08-02 12:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859204, 701164, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image, tac sharp love the prospective.</td>', 'Nice image, tac sharp love the prospective.', '2008-08-02 12:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859206, 705265, 58452, '<td valign="top">Unique way of showing both sides of a fireworks display.  The fire... and the  people.  Very nice.</td>', 'Unique way of showing both sides of a fireworks display.  The fire... and the  people.  Very nice.', '2008-08-02 12:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859208, 703321, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, the detail &amp; composition are well done.</td>', 'Nice capture, the detail & composition are well done.', '2008-08-02 12:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859211, 704157, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, love the selective lighting. The composition is well done.</td>', 'Nice capture, love the selective lighting. The composition is well done.', '2008-08-02 12:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859218, 695418, 58452, '<td valign="top">Like the way you captured the colors on this one.  Reminds me of my Kodachrome 64 and 25 slides from the early 80''s.  Nice.</td>', 'Like the way you captured the colors on this one.  Reminds me of my Kodachrome 64 and 25 slides from the early 80''s.  Nice.', '2008-08-02 12:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859220, 700132, 56254, '<td valign="top">just stunning ... adding to faves, good luck!</td>', 'just stunning ... adding to faves, good luck!', '2008-08-02 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859222, 701752, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice complimentary colors on this portrait. Best pet photo in the show so far.  Very nice.</td>', 'Nice complimentary colors on this portrait. Best pet photo in the show so far.  Very nice.', '2008-08-02 12:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859227, 704768, 70000, '<td valign="top">Incredible</td>', 'Incredible', '2008-08-02 12:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859228, 705080, 70000, '<td valign="top">The lighting creates the mood very well. Nice shot</td>', 'The lighting creates the mood very well. Nice shot', '2008-08-02 12:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859230, 704617, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow, really awesome shot. It is nice to see someone actually pay attention to lighting in a landscape. Unique shot. Very cool</td>', 'Wow, really awesome shot. It is nice to see someone actually pay attention to lighting in a landscape. Unique shot. Very cool', '2008-08-02 12:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859241, 705340, 67237, '<td valign="top">love the wb and depth of color here....London?</td>', 'love the wb and depth of color here....London?', '2008-08-02 12:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859246, 701752, 67237, '<td valign="top">impressing image....good luck!!</td>', 'impressing image....good luck!!', '2008-08-02 12:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859250, 698839, 67237, '<td valign="top">didn''t you see how the right hand came of?</td>', 'didn''t you see how the right hand came of?', '2008-08-02 12:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859256, 703122, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The composition is well done, nice detail.</td>', 'Nice capture. The composition is well done, nice detail.', '2008-08-02 12:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859274, 697763, 60698, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast!! It has that mysterious, magical feeling to it. The little one looks like it just popped up out of the ground! Nice choice for black and white!</td>', 'Love the contrast!! It has that mysterious, magical feeling to it. The little one looks like it just popped up out of the ground! Nice choice for black and white!', '2008-08-02 13:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859299, 703765, 77543, '<td valign="top">The threes are well positioned in the frame</td>', 'The threes are well positioned in the frame', '2008-08-02 13:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859309, 705153, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Very unusual and quite brave for this audience. It''s the non-technical love-or-hate-it kind of photo that would make a good focus on a wall or in a book. Good luck!</td>', 'Great shot. Very unusual and quite brave for this audience. It''s the non-technical love-or-hate-it kind of photo that would make a good focus on a wall or in a book. Good luck!', '2008-08-02 13:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859311, 704999, 77543, '<td valign="top">Would this have worked better in colour?</td>', 'Would this have worked better in colour?', '2008-08-02 13:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859313, 703902, 77543, '<td valign="top">Very good selection for the selective colour.</td>', 'Very good selection for the selective colour.', '2008-08-02 13:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859316, 705235, 77543, '<td valign="top">I think the background is too similar in colour to the subject.</td>', 'I think the background is too similar in colour to the subject.', '2008-08-02 13:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859317, 703454, 77543, '<td valign="top">There is nothing to focus on apart from the plant. It needs something like an insect at the point of focus.</td>', 'There is nothing to focus on apart from the plant. It needs something like an insect at the point of focus.', '2008-08-02 13:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859318, 703869, 30791, '<td valign="top">the dpcers are gonna love this one ;)</td>', 'the dpcers are gonna love this one ;)', '2008-08-02 13:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859320, 705355, 30791, '<td valign="top">very dreary image youve created here.</td>', 'very dreary image youve created here.', '2008-08-02 13:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859321, 700180, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d crop the top 20 or so pixels to remove the light area.</td>', 'I''d crop the top 20 or so pixels to remove the light area.', '2008-08-02 13:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859325, 700840, 8860, '<td valign="top">Your editing is a bit ropey near the tree horizon but your shot is a good one. You''ve got some well emphasised light, good foreground detail and texture.</td>', 'Your editing is a bit ropey near the tree horizon but your shot is a good one. You''ve got some well emphasised light, good foreground detail and texture.', '2008-08-02 13:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859335, 701582, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful exposure. While the subject doesn''t grab me by the b***s I can fully appreciate the rich depth to it and I bet it looks wonderful large.</td>', 'Beautiful exposure. While the subject doesn''t grab me by the b***s I can fully appreciate the rich depth to it and I bet it looks wonderful large.', '2008-08-02 13:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859340, 702727, 8860, '<td valign="top">Guh! Sand dunes - what a boring subject. This''ll get nowhere.<br/>; )<br/> <br/>Great light and nice sense of desolation/loneliness. The only gripe is that the image is a little overexposed in the sky and lacks a little sharpness in the foreground detail.</td>', 'Guh! Sand dunes - what a boring subject. This''ll get nowhere.; ) Great light and nice sense of desolation/loneliness. The only gripe is that the image is a little overexposed in the sky and lacks a little sharpness in the foreground detail.', '2008-08-02 13:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859341, 700087, 77543, '<td valign="top">Just like with a human portrait I''d like to see the face.</td>', 'Just like with a human portrait I''d like to see the face.', '2008-08-02 13:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859345, 701626, 77543, '<td valign="top">The selection around the subject is too obvious.</td>', 'The selection around the subject is too obvious.', '2008-08-02 13:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859346, 705223, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great station this isn''t it! Very photogenic, but I can;t recall seeing one at this time of day. Nice focus on the sign, but I feel your composition is a little top-heavy, although I do like the focus on the glass area. In a way I''d like it if this was even more abstract and the foreground less distinct. Nice job.</td>', 'Great station this isn''t it! Very photogenic, but I can;t recall seeing one at this time of day. Nice focus on the sign, but I feel your composition is a little top-heavy, although I do like the focus on the glass area. In a way I''d like it if this was even more abstract and the foreground less distinct. Nice job.', '2008-08-02 13:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859352, 700634, 8860, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective and evocative. Love it.</td>', 'Simple, effective and evocative. Love it.', '2008-08-02 13:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859364, 697300, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cracking shot. Subject is dull as dishwater, but hey.<br/>; )<br/> <br/>I''d have cropped out the near foreground though as it detracts from the main forms. Beautiful light.</td>', 'Cracking shot. Subject is dull as dishwater, but hey.; ) I''d have cropped out the near foreground though as it detracts from the main forms. Beautiful light.', '2008-08-02 14:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859379, 704832, 77543, '<td valign="top">Would this be better in colour?</td>', 'Would this be better in colour?', '2008-08-02 14:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859386, 705251, 30791, '<td valign="top">awwwwwww</td>', 'awwwwwww', '2008-08-02 14:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859395, 703697, 30791, '<td valign="top">so clear! its like HD<br/>adding to favs, love this shot</td>', 'so clear! its like HDadding to favs, love this shot', '2008-08-02 14:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859403, 702349, 66952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky.</td>', 'Beautiful sky.', '2008-08-02 14:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859405, 704411, 66952, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a flying bird. You might want to crop so that it has more space in front to fly into.</td>', 'Nice capture of a flying bird. You might want to crop so that it has more space in front to fly into.', '2008-08-02 14:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859409, 704680, 66952, '<td valign="top">Dark, forbidding. I like the image a lot, although I think it needs a title that''s less wimpy.</td>', 'Dark, forbidding. I like the image a lot, although I think it needs a title that''s less wimpy.', '2008-08-02 14:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859414, 705018, 66952, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like somewhere I''d want to live. :P <br/> <br/>Shows the character of the place well.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like somewhere I''d want to live. :P  Shows the character of the place well.', '2008-08-02 14:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859417, 704828, 66952, '<td valign="top">Overall, really nice. The out of focus leg doesn''t really work, but the rest is well lit and evocative.</td>', 'Overall, really nice. The out of focus leg doesn''t really work, but the rest is well lit and evocative.', '2008-08-02 14:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859420, 700634, 66952, '<td valign="top">Seems wet! Nicely captured and processed.</td>', 'Seems wet! Nicely captured and processed.', '2008-08-02 14:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859423, 703899, 66952, '<td valign="top">Fun. Hard to change, since the giraffes are in the shade, but the giraffes need to be brighter, and the background darker. My eye keeps getting drawn to the bright spot in between them.</td>', 'Fun. Hard to change, since the giraffes are in the shade, but the giraffes need to be brighter, and the background darker. My eye keeps getting drawn to the bright spot in between them.', '2008-08-02 14:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859426, 701781, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the line of sand sweeping towards the rocks. That''s excellent. The cloudy sky and flat light are letting you down.</td>', 'I like the line of sand sweeping towards the rocks. That''s excellent. The cloudy sky and flat light are letting you down.', '2008-08-02 14:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859430, 703902, 66952, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the bee on the flower. When I try to do this, the bee is always upside down and backwards. I''m not sure the partial desat works. It isolates the bee from the background, but it just seems really obvious.</td>', 'Great job capturing the bee on the flower. When I try to do this, the bee is always upside down and backwards. I''m not sure the partial desat works. It isolates the bee from the background, but it just seems really obvious.', '2008-08-02 14:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859484, 695418, 77543, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness of the butterfly but I think there is too much happening in the background.</td>', 'I like the sharpness of the butterfly but I think there is too much happening in the background.', '2008-08-02 14:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859486, 703624, 77543, '<td valign="top">I think it''s at the wrong angle - I''d like to see it filling the diagonal of the picture.</td>', 'I think it''s at the wrong angle - I''d like to see it filling the diagonal of the picture.', '2008-08-02 14:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859488, 698751, 77543, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit too much sky.</td>', 'There''s a bit too much sky.', '2008-08-02 14:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859491, 705020, 77543, '<td valign="top">The flower should be in the space between the lilies - rather than so low in the frame.</td>', 'The flower should be in the space between the lilies - rather than so low in the frame.', '2008-08-02 14:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859492, 705255, 77543, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this would look in colour.</td>', 'I wonder how this would look in colour.', '2008-08-02 14:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859498, 704693, 77543, '<td valign="top">There''s not much detail in the head. was it cropped from a much larger image or sharpened from a slightly soft original.</td>', 'There''s not much detail in the head. was it cropped from a much larger image or sharpened from a slightly soft original.', '2008-08-02 14:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859499, 700445, 76598, '<td valign="top">the lens certainly doesn''t complement him</td>', 'the lens certainly doesn''t complement him', '2008-08-02 14:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859501, 695556, 76598, '<td valign="top">the face is far too smoothed for my taste, almost looks alien</td>', 'the face is far too smoothed for my taste, almost looks alien', '2008-08-02 14:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859504, 704603, 77543, '<td valign="top">I think I''d prefer this without the burst of sun ie with the subject slightly to the left.</td>', 'I think I''d prefer this without the burst of sun ie with the subject slightly to the left.', '2008-08-02 14:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859505, 701191, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good separation from the background</td>', 'Good separation from the background', '2008-08-02 14:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859509, 697300, 76598, '<td valign="top">a little dark IMO</td>', 'a little dark IMO', '2008-08-02 14:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859513, 705348, 77543, '<td valign="top">The frame colours are well chosen.</td>', 'The frame colours are well chosen.', '2008-08-02 14:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859534, 704479, 76598, '<td valign="top">use more pixels</td>', 'use more pixels', '2008-08-02 15:00:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4859535, 695334, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good try but the subject is not fully in the frame and the shutter speed is too slow.</td>', 'Good try but the subject is not fully in the frame and the shutter speed is too slow.', '2008-08-02 15:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859538, 702380, 77543, '<td valign="top">The white bar in the top right corner is a distraction.</td>', 'The white bar in the top right corner is a distraction.', '2008-08-02 15:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859541, 696816, 77543, '<td valign="top">My eye is drawn to the bright lights in the building on the far right.</td>', 'My eye is drawn to the bright lights in the building on the far right.', '2008-08-02 15:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859545, 703279, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d crop to remove the telegraph poles on the left.</td>', 'I''d crop to remove the telegraph poles on the left.', '2008-08-02 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859552, 703899, 77543, '<td valign="top">They look a little under exposed.</td>', 'They look a little under exposed.', '2008-08-02 15:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859559, 704599, 77543, '<td valign="top">The composition is good but the subject is blurred.</td>', 'The composition is good but the subject is blurred.', '2008-08-02 15:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859577, 705345, 33769, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful photo - but I would reccomend tweeking the levels a little to get the contrast to pop more; or even just slight curves in post-processing  (saving for DPC sometimes lowers the quality of an original pic so i''m sure the original is amazing)  I think a pic showing her arms a little more would be nice- as it is she looks like she doesn''t have any; tho I can see that they''re behind her back because I see the edge of one... - kids are a tough subject they never want to do what you ask them to and usually its candid-moments  -as a mom I understand that! :) :-) Kudos and compliments on a lovely subject!!  look forward to seeing more in your portfolio!</td>', 'this is a beautiful photo - but I would reccomend tweeking the levels a little to get the contrast to pop more; or even just slight curves in post-processing  (saving for DPC sometimes lowers the quality of an original pic so i''m sure the original is amazing)  I think a pic showing her arms a little more would be nice- as it is she looks like she doesn''t have any; tho I can see that they''re behind her back because I see the edge of one... - kids are a tough subject they never want to do what you ask them to and usually its candid-moments  -as a mom I understand that! :) :-) Kudos and compliments on a lovely subject!!  look forward to seeing more in your portfolio!', '2008-08-02 15:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859594, 702202, 61234, '<td valign="top">Hey, this looks familiar. I spent a few days here last week taking pictures.<br/>I love this spot and photograph it through the seasons. Nice capture!</td>', 'Hey, this looks familiar. I spent a few days here last week taking pictures.I love this spot and photograph it through the seasons. Nice capture!', '2008-08-02 15:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859624, 697300, 40355, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape, great sense of depth.  The contrasts are excellent: light and shadow, rought and smooth.  10</td>', 'Lovely landscape, great sense of depth.  The contrasts are excellent: light and shadow, rought and smooth.  10', '2008-08-02 15:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859625, 696166, 40355, '<td valign="top">An excellent portrait, very well composed and shot.  I really like how the blue of his eyes matches the blue in the background.  Color contrasts here are well presented.  10</td>', 'An excellent portrait, very well composed and shot.  I really like how the blue of his eyes matches the blue in the background.  Color contrasts here are well presented.  10', '2008-08-02 15:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859627, 704768, 40355, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, very dramatic.  The softness of the clouds and ocean contrast well with the sharp edges of the city.  Also like the figure down the beach, adds a point of small detail interest. 10</td>', 'Lovely scene, very dramatic.  The softness of the clouds and ocean contrast well with the sharp edges of the city.  Also like the figure down the beach, adds a point of small detail interest. 10', '2008-08-02 15:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859630, 695556, 40355, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait!  Very well lit.  I''m a fan of the background; not sure if it''s a shadow or just some shading on the BG itself, but it looks good and helps pull her away from it just enough. 9</td>', 'Beautiful portrait!  Very well lit.  I''m a fan of the background; not sure if it''s a shadow or just some shading on the BG itself, but it looks good and helps pull her away from it just enough. 9', '2008-08-02 15:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859631, 703296, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very minimalist - I''m a fan.  The color range in the sky is pleasing to view, the clouds break it up a little but in a way that I think works.  There''s just enough of the rocks included at the bottom and the fisherman is tucked into the corner in a way that feels natural.  10</td>', 'Very minimalist - I''m a fan.  The color range in the sky is pleasing to view, the clouds break it up a little but in a way that I think works.  There''s just enough of the rocks included at the bottom and the fisherman is tucked into the corner in a way that feels natural.  10', '2008-08-02 15:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859633, 704105, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best aviation shots that I have seen in a very long time!  Very dramatic, excellently composed.  This is getting listed as a favorite and I''d love to see about buying a print of it.  10</td>', 'This is one of the best aviation shots that I have seen in a very long time!  Very dramatic, excellently composed.  This is getting listed as a favorite and I''d love to see about buying a print of it.  10', '2008-08-02 15:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859635, 703470, 40355, '<td valign="top">I think the colors really make this shot, the contrast between the warm tones in the sky and the cool tones in the city, yet the way that the warm sky reflects off points in the city and mixes in.  Very well done.  10</td>', 'I think the colors really make this shot, the contrast between the warm tones in the sky and the cool tones in the city, yet the way that the warm sky reflects off points in the city and mixes in.  Very well done.  10', '2008-08-02 15:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859636, 705303, 40355, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph!  Colors are amazing and the subjects are soothing and pleasant to look at.  Can''t tell for sure if this is an HDR shot - if so, it''s very subtle and well done.  And if not, then you did a great job getting the entire dynamic range in.  10</td>', 'Beautiful photograph!  Colors are amazing and the subjects are soothing and pleasant to look at.  Can''t tell for sure if this is an HDR shot - if so, it''s very subtle and well done.  And if not, then you did a great job getting the entire dynamic range in.  10', '2008-08-02 15:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859637, 704063, 40355, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite photos in this challenge, and probably on DPC.  Very minimalistic, which I appreciate.  Subtle colors, subtle texture in the BG but just enough on the tree.  Makes me wish I was really there. 10</td>', 'One of my favorite photos in this challenge, and probably on DPC.  Very minimalistic, which I appreciate.  Subtle colors, subtle texture in the BG but just enough on the tree.  Makes me wish I was really there. 10', '2008-08-02 15:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859639, 697519, 40355, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  The tones are just great, everything from pure white to rich black.  Very dramatic scene, excellent sense of depth repeated in both the trail and the clouds.  10</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  The tones are just great, everything from pure white to rich black.  Very dramatic scene, excellent sense of depth repeated in both the trail and the clouds.  10', '2008-08-02 15:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859640, 703379, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent capture!  I really hope that you''re a university photographer, or at least work for the school, because they''ve got to love this shot.  I work freelance for a university and know that they''d just about kill for a shot like this.  Some might wish her face were visible, but I like it as it is - the motion and energy of it is captured very well. 10</td>', 'This is an excellent capture!  I really hope that you''re a university photographer, or at least work for the school, because they''ve got to love this shot.  I work freelance for a university and know that they''d just about kill for a shot like this.  Some might wish her face were visible, but I like it as it is - the motion and energy of it is captured very well. 10', '2008-08-02 15:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859644, 705384, 40355, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot and more complex than it first appears.  I originally liked it for the waterfalls and the foam circling in the pool.  Then I noticed the bridge in the BG and the person on it, which gives it a whole new aspect.  Add in the detail in the land and it becomes even more beautiful.  Definitely a 10.</td>', 'Amazing shot and more complex than it first appears.  I originally liked it for the waterfalls and the foam circling in the pool.  Then I noticed the bridge in the BG and the person on it, which gives it a whole new aspect.  Add in the detail in the land and it becomes even more beautiful.  Definitely a 10.', '2008-08-02 15:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859648, 705261, 40355, '<td valign="top">Remarkable landscape and very well photographed.  I like the mixing of warm and cool tones throughout, as well as the way that the puddles in the foreground somewhat match the shape and distribution of the clouds in the top left.  It''s subtle, but I see it as a mirroring effect.  The only thing I might have done differently is to crop it so that there was only the one central mountain, ending up in the upper right corner, instead of including the smaller hill that''s partly cropped out.  10</td>', 'Remarkable landscape and very well photographed.  I like the mixing of warm and cool tones throughout, as well as the way that the puddles in the foreground somewhat match the shape and distribution of the clouds in the top left.  It''s subtle, but I see it as a mirroring effect.  The only thing I might have done differently is to crop it so that there was only the one central mountain, ending up in the upper right corner, instead of including the smaller hill that''s partly cropped out.  10', '2008-08-02 16:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859655, 704065, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photo and one of the most beautiful I''ve seen here in a long time.  This was one of those moments and you were very lucky to capture it!  The range in color temperature is just great, and the details are too.  There''s real texture in the clouds, which works well with the texture in the grass.  And having the trees across the horizon as true black silhouettes really gives a defining line through the scene.  Definitely a favorite and a 10.</td>', 'This is an amazing photo and one of the most beautiful I''ve seen here in a long time.  This was one of those moments and you were very lucky to capture it!  The range in color temperature is just great, and the details are too.  There''s real texture in the clouds, which works well with the texture in the grass.  And having the trees across the horizon as true black silhouettes really gives a defining line through the scene.  Definitely a favorite and a 10.', '2008-08-02 16:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859662, 705212, 77543, '<td valign="top">The birds blend into the background. But nice reflection of the distant bird.</td>', 'The birds blend into the background. But nice reflection of the distant bird.', '2008-08-02 16:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859664, 705334, 77543, '<td valign="top">The sky is quite bland in the picture - it could do with some extra saturation.</td>', 'The sky is quite bland in the picture - it could do with some extra saturation.', '2008-08-02 16:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4859666, 705396, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the model is good. The dark dress is so dark that there''s no detail on my screen.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the model is good. The dark dress is so dark that there''s no detail on my screen.', '2008-08-02 16:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
