(4860381, 705212, 46046, '<td valign="top">there is a shot here I think with a TON of post......there are just too many distractions (some as large as the birds) to give me any sense of what the tension is here.....a little low res too......I do like the reflection you''ve captured with the top bird.......</td>', 'there is a shot here I think with a TON of post......there are just too many distractions (some as large as the birds) to give me any sense of what the tension is here.....a little low res too......I do like the reflection you''ve captured with the top bird.......', '2008-08-03 00:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
