(4860391, 700538, 46046, '<td valign="top">I bet this looks STELLAR poster size........nice job to keep detail in the blacks ..... doesn''t work quite as well at this viewing size (I know that is out of your hands)  Nice image.</td>', 'I bet this looks STELLAR poster size........nice job to keep detail in the blacks ..... doesn''t work quite as well at this viewing size (I know that is out of your hands)  Nice image.', '2008-08-03 00:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
