(4860804, 704143, 3306, '<td valign="top">You have a terrific eye. This is a very interesting picture. One could read alot into this image. The stripes on the shirt and on the wall are what first catches your attention. Then I realized it was a young orthodox jewish boy and it conjures up memories of the holocaust and yet to me he is outside the stripes representing that he is free of a repressive past. A sad yet happy picture. Anyway, everyone has their own interpretation I am sure. Great shot.</td>', 'You have a terrific eye. This is a very interesting picture. One could read alot into this image. The stripes on the shirt and on the wall are what first catches your attention. Then I realized it was a young orthodox jewish boy and it conjures up memories of the holocaust and yet to me he is outside the stripes representing that he is free of a repressive past. A sad yet happy picture. Anyway, everyone has their own interpretation I am sure. Great shot.', '2008-08-03 07:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
