(4862571, 702573, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think the skin has been processed too much.  But, that''s my opinion... not the law.  *smile*<br/> <br/>A beautiful choice of the scarf.  The model is wonderful... I would really like to see this without so much processing on the skin.  I think it would be a ten.  The light and focus are perfect.</td>', 'I think the skin has been processed too much.  But, that''s my opinion... not the law.  *smile* A beautiful choice of the scarf.  The model is wonderful... I would really like to see this without so much processing on the skin.  I think it would be a ten.  The light and focus are perfect.', '2008-08-03 23:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862575, 698943, 86447, '<td valign="top">The focus isn''t as sharp as it could be, I fear.  And a modern, metal trailer would be better not seen in a pastoral image, I think.</td>', 'The focus isn''t as sharp as it could be, I fear.  And a modern, metal trailer would be better not seen in a pastoral image, I think.', '2008-08-03 23:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
