(4862691, 705358, 60614, '<td valign="top">I just love old weathered buildings.  They have a story they want to tell.  Great detail in the old shingles and the nice dramatic tones.  I know some won''t like it because the tones are a bit dark but I think that is what makes the photo.  Great processing and good luck.</td>', 'I just love old weathered buildings.  They have a story they want to tell.  Great detail in the old shingles and the nice dramatic tones.  I know some won''t like it because the tones are a bit dark but I think that is what makes the photo.  Great processing and good luck.', '2008-08-04 00:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4862714, 705054, 60614, '<td valign="top">Very interesting processing.  All I can say is I like it and good luck.</td>', 'Very interesting processing.  All I can say is I like it and good luck.', '2008-08-04 00:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
