(4864014, 705190, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and sharp throughout to really present the detail well - tough to do with something of this scale - I''m very impressed!  And lovely light to bring out the gold.</td>', 'Very crisp and sharp throughout to really present the detail well - tough to do with something of this scale - I''m very impressed!  And lovely light to bring out the gold.', '2008-08-04 13:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864019, 705235, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet golden tones in this.</td>', 'Sweet golden tones in this.', '2008-08-04 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864023, 705300, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a nice thing to come home to if you lived there.</td>', 'What a nice thing to come home to if you lived there.', '2008-08-04 13:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864031, 705210, 30982, '<td valign="top">And he comes with his own fly!  I love the detail - the little green whatever they are all over the water surface and the prince.  He''s a cutie!</td>', 'And he comes with his own fly!  I love the detail - the little green whatever they are all over the water surface and the prince.  He''s a cutie!', '2008-08-04 13:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864036, 704105, 92864, '<td valign="top">Super crisp. Lovely composition.</td>', 'Super crisp. Lovely composition.', '2008-08-04 13:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864041, 696507, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sure, that''s what they all say.  But that doesn''t explain the 50% divorce rate... :-)  Seriously, though, I like the aggressive angle on this and you caught a great look between them.</td>', 'Sure, that''s what they all say.  But that doesn''t explain the 50% divorce rate... :-)  Seriously, though, I like the aggressive angle on this and you caught a great look between them.', '2008-08-04 13:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864042, 694634, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet light, lovely arrangement of the flowers.</td>', 'Sweet light, lovely arrangement of the flowers.', '2008-08-04 13:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864044, 703455, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kind of shot - wonderful handling of all that white!</td>', 'My kind of shot - wonderful handling of all that white!', '2008-08-04 13:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864047, 703853, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I recall another challenge awhile back with an environmental portrait that this reminds me of - I"ll have to see if its the same photog.  At any rate, the perfect shot for a bone guy - love the looks you captured on both subjects!</td>', 'Excellent!  I recall another challenge awhile back with an environmental portrait that this reminds me of - I"ll have to see if its the same photog.  At any rate, the perfect shot for a bone guy - love the looks you captured on both subjects!', '2008-08-04 14:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864070, 697673, 77543, '<td valign="top">The composition is good - I''m not keen on the effect you''ve used.</td>', 'The composition is good - I''m not keen on the effect you''ve used.', '2008-08-04 14:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864072, 703434, 77543, '<td valign="top">There''s a very large object on the bottom right of the frame in the way.</td>', 'There''s a very large object on the bottom right of the frame in the way.', '2008-08-04 14:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864076, 700840, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d have tried an even slower shutter speed to make the water even smoother.</td>', 'I''d have tried an even slower shutter speed to make the water even smoother.', '2008-08-04 14:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864078, 704159, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d have held the camera up higher or cropped the bottom to remove the hammock in the bottom right corner.</td>', 'I''d have held the camera up higher or cropped the bottom to remove the hammock in the bottom right corner.', '2008-08-04 14:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864082, 705347, 67258, '<td valign="top">he lack of any real detail in the plumage - cerainly no rendition of texture - suggests that this is a crop from a much lager photo.  Assuming I am right, I feel that you would have been better going for a much less tightly cropped image.</td>', 'he lack of any real detail in the plumage - cerainly no rendition of texture - suggests that this is a crop from a much lager photo.  Assuming I am right, I feel that you would have been better going for a much less tightly cropped image.', '2008-08-04 14:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864087, 705265, 67258, '<td valign="top">An unusual take on the ubiquitous July 4th shot, and one that works well.</td>', 'An unusual take on the ubiquitous July 4th shot, and one that works well.', '2008-08-04 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864091, 699208, 77543, '<td valign="top">Why is only one table well lite?</td>', 'Why is only one table well lite?', '2008-08-04 14:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864093, 705227, 67258, '<td valign="top">I love the one shoeless foot.  Super find, and well timed.</td>', 'I love the one shoeless foot.  Super find, and well timed.', '2008-08-04 14:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864095, 703534, 77543, '<td valign="top">It would be better if the horizon was on a third rather than half up the frame.</td>', 'It would be better if the horizon was on a third rather than half up the frame.', '2008-08-04 14:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864101, 696189, 77543, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit soft. There''s a dark patch just above the top of the head that looks like an attempt to remove something from the background.</td>', 'It''s a bit soft. There''s a dark patch just above the top of the head that looks like an attempt to remove something from the background.', '2008-08-04 14:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864104, 697462, 77543, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting pattern made by the sparkler.</td>', 'That''s an interesting pattern made by the sparkler.', '2008-08-04 14:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864105, 704479, 66515, '<td valign="top">Make use of the full size allowed. This is really too small to judge effectively.</td>', 'Make use of the full size allowed. This is really too small to judge effectively.', '2008-08-04 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864107, 704647, 77543, '<td valign="top">It needs more depth of field so the ear is as sharp as the trunk.</td>', 'It needs more depth of field so the ear is as sharp as the trunk.', '2008-08-04 14:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864110, 704652, 77543, '<td valign="top">I think there''s too much empty space.</td>', 'I think there''s too much empty space.', '2008-08-04 14:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864113, 704890, 77543, '<td valign="top">The angle makes this a more interesting picture. Did you try another version where she looked at the camera via the mirror?</td>', 'The angle makes this a more interesting picture. Did you try another version where she looked at the camera via the mirror?', '2008-08-04 14:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864115, 704217, 77543, '<td valign="top">The clouds look they are a volcanic eruption.</td>', 'The clouds look they are a volcanic eruption.', '2008-08-04 14:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864119, 699736, 77543, '<td valign="top">The bright areas on the left and right are a major distraction.</td>', 'The bright areas on the left and right are a major distraction.', '2008-08-04 14:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864124, 701520, 66515, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this with the horizon levelled off. The land might have tilted that way but in a photo without knowing this for sure it just looks off. <br/> <br/>I think that framing this with less of the silhouetted foreground might have been effective. The sky is gorgeous and the silhouette of the trees balance it well but everything under the horizon is more or less dead black space that draws your eyes away from the sky.</td>', 'I would like to see this with the horizon levelled off. The land might have tilted that way but in a photo without knowing this for sure it just looks off.  I think that framing this with less of the silhouetted foreground might have been effective. The sky is gorgeous and the silhouette of the trees balance it well but everything under the horizon is more or less dead black space that draws your eyes away from the sky.', '2008-08-04 14:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864131, 702831, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice capture with good focus...except for the eyes. Aside from that I love the action you captured. The exposure is well handled particularly in the chest. It starts getting bright but it does have detail.</td>', 'Nice capture with good focus...except for the eyes. Aside from that I love the action you captured. The exposure is well handled particularly in the chest. It starts getting bright but it does have detail.', '2008-08-04 14:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864133, 700634, 66515, '<td valign="top">I would really like to see this in color. I can just "see" gradients of green in this shot that should be shared.</td>', 'I would really like to see this in color. I can just "see" gradients of green in this shot that should be shared.', '2008-08-04 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864138, 701597, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d have tried shooting this from a slightly different position so as to eliminate the roses in the background.</td>', 'I''d have tried shooting this from a slightly different position so as to eliminate the roses in the background.', '2008-08-04 14:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864140, 704709, 77543, '<td valign="top">I wonder what happened after you took this picture.</td>', 'I wonder what happened after you took this picture.', '2008-08-04 14:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864142, 703898, 77543, '<td valign="top">I think would be better rotated 90 degrees anti-clockwise.</td>', 'I think would be better rotated 90 degrees anti-clockwise.', '2008-08-04 14:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864147, 704161, 77543, '<td valign="top">The path doesn''t lead to anywhere. I''d crop so the path ends in the corner of the frame.</td>', 'The path doesn''t lead to anywhere. I''d crop so the path ends in the corner of the frame.', '2008-08-04 14:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864148, 703906, 66515, '<td valign="top">You can go up to 720 px on the longest side. Even with basic editing you are allowed 640 px. Let us really see what you are trying to show us.</td>', 'You can go up to 720 px on the longest side. Even with basic editing you are allowed 640 px. Let us really see what you are trying to show us.', '2008-08-04 14:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864181, 704346, 43667, '<td valign="top">More focus on the bee would have been nice.</td>', 'More focus on the bee would have been nice.', '2008-08-04 15:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864218, 704529, 43667, '<td valign="top">Very creative</td>', 'Very creative', '2008-08-04 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864237, 700051, 43667, '<td valign="top">It seems like there was too much noise reduction in this photo.</td>', 'It seems like there was too much noise reduction in this photo.', '2008-08-04 15:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864275, 705266, 77543, '<td valign="top">There''s not much technically wrong with this picture it''s just not very interesting.</td>', 'There''s not much technically wrong with this picture it''s just not very interesting.', '2008-08-04 16:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864280, 700276, 77543, '<td valign="top">There''s a  large area of field in the foreground which has nothing of interest. I''d crop to remove most of it.</td>', 'There''s a  large area of field in the foreground which has nothing of interest. I''d crop to remove most of it.', '2008-08-04 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864286, 697396, 77543, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the face and softness of the arms and legs makes it look like there is no connection between the face and the rest of the body.</td>', 'The sharpness of the face and softness of the arms and legs makes it look like there is no connection between the face and the rest of the body.', '2008-08-04 16:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864303, 703914, 77543, '<td valign="top">The tree line makes a nice shape.</td>', 'The tree line makes a nice shape.', '2008-08-04 16:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864306, 702140, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d crop to remove the trees in the background - just leave the field of sunflowers.</td>', 'I''d crop to remove the trees in the background - just leave the field of sunflowers.', '2008-08-04 16:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864308, 705353, 77543, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice softness to this image. The colours are a little bland, though.</td>', 'There''s a nice softness to this image. The colours are a little bland, though.', '2008-08-04 16:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864313, 700338, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a bit more reflection and a bit less sky.</td>', 'I''d like to see a bit more reflection and a bit less sky.', '2008-08-04 16:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864325, 705360, 77543, '<td valign="top">The flowers in the corner are a nice touch. Would this have been better in colour?</td>', 'The flowers in the corner are a nice touch. Would this have been better in colour?', '2008-08-04 16:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864328, 704599, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m betting if you''re getting comments, it''s about the bird not being in focus.  Well, pah on that.  I happen to love that the bird is not in focus.  I love the motion behind the bird (and don''t even care what it is).  I love the stubbornness that I see here (don''t know why, but I do) and I like the strength this conveys.  About the only thing I could live without is the frame, but that''s neither here nor there - the picture''s the thing, and I like this one.</td>', 'I''m betting if you''re getting comments, it''s about the bird not being in focus.  Well, pah on that.  I happen to love that the bird is not in focus.  I love the motion behind the bird (and don''t even care what it is).  I love the stubbornness that I see here (don''t know why, but I do) and I like the strength this conveys.  About the only thing I could live without is the frame, but that''s neither here nor there - the picture''s the thing, and I like this one.', '2008-08-04 16:30:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4864329, 703470, 30982, '<td valign="top">I happen to love wide angle city shots and this one is very nicely done.</td>', 'I happen to love wide angle city shots and this one is very nicely done.', '2008-08-04 16:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864330, 702283, 30982, '<td valign="top">I know it''s just a fly and all but it''s still kinda sad.</td>', 'I know it''s just a fly and all but it''s still kinda sad.', '2008-08-04 16:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864333, 700084, 77543, '<td valign="top">It looks like something is missing from the top of this stump.</td>', 'It looks like something is missing from the top of this stump.', '2008-08-04 16:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864334, 703434, 30982, '<td valign="top">You may hear that the foreground is distracting.  I think it''s very apropos given the subject.  SOmething like this always seems somewhat removed and protected from the general populace, and this shows that well.</td>', 'You may hear that the foreground is distracting.  I think it''s very apropos given the subject.  SOmething like this always seems somewhat removed and protected from the general populace, and this shows that well.', '2008-08-04 16:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864336, 699173, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great expression.  Really an unusual and unusually effective location for a portrait of sorts.</td>', 'Great expression.  Really an unusual and unusually effective location for a portrait of sorts.', '2008-08-04 16:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864337, 695240, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but this is really appealing.  Oh, wait.  It could be the eyes.  :-)  I do like the post processing, even if it is a bit tending toward the "art" side.  I think it fits this shot well.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but this is really appealing.  Oh, wait.  It could be the eyes.  :-)  I do like the post processing, even if it is a bit tending toward the "art" side.  I think it fits this shot well.', '2008-08-04 16:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864338, 701889, 77543, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity about the leaf at the top left. Perhaps this should be cropped out.</td>', 'It''s a pity about the leaf at the top left. Perhaps this should be cropped out.', '2008-08-04 16:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864339, 700766, 30982, '<td valign="top">Delightful!</td>', 'Delightful!', '2008-08-04 16:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864340, 695374, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of contre-jour.  I love the color created by shooting into the sun.</td>', 'Beautiful use of contre-jour.  I love the color created by shooting into the sun.', '2008-08-04 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864341, 702939, 77543, '<td valign="top">The thick cable running almost horizontally across the upper third seems out of place.</td>', 'The thick cable running almost horizontally across the upper third seems out of place.', '2008-08-04 16:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864342, 701192, 77543, '<td valign="top">It looks like it was shoot through a net curtain.</td>', 'It looks like it was shoot through a net curtain.', '2008-08-04 16:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864346, 703157, 77543, '<td valign="top">I like the gradient in the sky. I''d crop it to loose most of the foreground in the bottom right of the frame.</td>', 'I like the gradient in the sky. I''d crop it to loose most of the foreground in the bottom right of the frame.', '2008-08-04 16:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864360, 704285, 77543, '<td valign="top">The cheek is a little too bright and half of the left eye is in shadow.</td>', 'The cheek is a little too bright and half of the left eye is in shadow.', '2008-08-04 16:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864366, 701752, 77543, '<td valign="top">The lighting is nice but has left a harsh shadow - a reflector or fill light on the right would help.</td>', 'The lighting is nice but has left a harsh shadow - a reflector or fill light on the right would help.', '2008-08-04 16:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
