(4865374, 705195, 91776, '<td valign="top">i think that the portrait its the most difficult discipline... but you ar made a very good job, the colour , tone everythings its a great job, and nine for me</td>', 'i think that the portrait its the most difficult discipline... but you ar made a very good job, the colour , tone everythings its a great job, and nine for me', '2008-08-04 20:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
