(4865389, 702974, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. It feels like I''m getting pulled into this image. The distortion and the guy''s jacket enhances that perception.</td>', 'Nice shot. It feels like I''m getting pulled into this image. The distortion and the guy''s jacket enhances that perception.', '2008-08-04 20:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4865395, 702949, 24896, '<td valign="top">A great capture and a very nice burn job. Just a couple openings in the frame that don''t have matching sky behind them. It could be the sun but just looks missed to me, I doubt too many others will see it. Still and awesome shot and a 10 from me. Best of luck. Scott <br/>Please let me know if I was right or not. The feedback would be great as I am trying to work on details myself. thx</td>', 'A great capture and a very nice burn job. Just a couple openings in the frame that don''t have matching sky behind them. It could be the sun but just looks missed to me, I doubt too many others will see it. Still and awesome shot and a 10 from me. Best of luck. Scott Please let me know if I was right or not. The feedback would be great as I am trying to work on details myself. thx', '2008-08-04 20:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4865404, 695517, 24896, '<td valign="top">Brilliant color, focus, and just the right amount of DOF. 10 Best of luck. Scott</td>', 'Brilliant color, focus, and just the right amount of DOF. 10 Best of luck. Scott', '2008-08-04 20:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4865419, 699489, 24896, '<td valign="top">Great capture! love the eye contact with the one on the right and the one on the left getting its itch fixed. I wonder if a little brightness bump would help and not start to clip anything!?!? 10 Best of Luck. Scott</td>', 'Great capture! love the eye contact with the one on the right and the one on the left getting its itch fixed. I wonder if a little brightness bump would help and not start to clip anything!?!? 10 Best of Luck. Scott', '2008-08-04 21:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4865424, 700132, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the zen-like feel of the birds in in the distance and how the fog wraps around them and the waves moving towards me. The birds in flight are cool but for me I could do without them or at least less of them. Excellent shot nonetheless.</td>', 'I like the zen-like feel of the birds in in the distance and how the fog wraps around them and the waves moving towards me. The birds in flight are cool but for me I could do without them or at least less of them. Excellent shot nonetheless.', '2008-08-04 21:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4865425, 705231, 24896, '<td valign="top">Awesome contrast between the bubbles and the (oh so smooth) skin tones. Perfect mix of light and shadows to add lots of depth. Great color on the lips and eyes. RAZOR SHARP!!! Very SEXY!! and a very good edit. Truly a keeper and a 10 from me. Best of luck. Scott</td>', 'Awesome contrast between the bubbles and the (oh so smooth) skin tones. Perfect mix of light and shadows to add lots of depth. Great color on the lips and eyes. RAZOR SHARP!!! Very SEXY!! and a very good edit. Truly a keeper and a 10 from me. Best of luck. Scott', '2008-08-04 21:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
