(4865469, 703379, 24896, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!!! just a great capture. I would love to know how you got "the look" of this photo. A couple little things that catch my eye. The heel on her left shoot is very blown out (but I love the effect on the shoe laces) and it looks like some of the printing on the wall has been edited out!? I wonder if this was intentional or not? If you could shoot me a PM with the details on the edit and if was correct or not about the printing edit I would be very appreciative. As I am trying to work on details myself.<br/>A very worthy 10 from me for an awesome capture and edit.<br/>Best of luck. Scott</td>', 'AWESOME!!! just a great capture. I would love to know how you got "the look" of this photo. A couple little things that catch my eye. The heel on her left shoot is very blown out (but I love the effect on the shoe laces) and it looks like some of the printing on the wall has been edited out!? I wonder if this was intentional or not? If you could shoot me a PM with the details on the edit and if was correct or not about the printing edit I would be very appreciative. As I am trying to work on details myself.A very worthy 10 from me for an awesome capture and edit.Best of luck. Scott', '2008-08-04 21:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
