(4865496, 705333, 56002, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  Transition to oof is smoth and lovely, tones are nice, bg is moody, look is meaningful, pose is superb.  Well done all ''round.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  Transition to oof is smoth and lovely, tones are nice, bg is moody, look is meaningful, pose is superb.  Well done all ''round.', '2008-08-04 21:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
