(4866070, 705255, 58452, '<td valign="top">This composition gives me a very strange feeling. The branches almost seem to be reaching in to grab the little stone cottage.  Being IR really adds to the stranger in a strange land feeling.</td>', 'This composition gives me a very strange feeling. The branches almost seem to be reaching in to grab the little stone cottage.  Being IR really adds to the stranger in a strange land feeling.', '2008-08-05 03:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4866072, 705184, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice composition considering the numerous distractions you had to deal with. The sky is nice, but I wonder if you''d hauled the PP in about 40 percent it would be nicer?  Congrats.</td>', 'Nice composition considering the numerous distractions you had to deal with. The sky is nice, but I wonder if you''d hauled the PP in about 40 percent it would be nicer?  Congrats.', '2008-08-05 03:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
