(4866082, 704529, 58452, '<td valign="top">There''s something disturbing about this composition. But I like the arrangement of elements in your composition. Maybe the black eyes are distracting me. LOL I expected to see the drawn vertical board lines extend above the circle. That kept me looking at your very strange subject. I can''t tell if it''s posed there or hanging in the air from your shutter! In any event all your elements work together to form a very strange whole.  Nice work.</td>', 'There''s something disturbing about this composition. But I like the arrangement of elements in your composition. Maybe the black eyes are distracting me. LOL I expected to see the drawn vertical board lines extend above the circle. That kept me looking at your very strange subject. I can''t tell if it''s posed there or hanging in the air from your shutter! In any event all your elements work together to form a very strange whole.  Nice work.', '2008-08-05 03:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
