(4867035, 705407, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasing wedding dress shot; the long delicate grasses match nicely with the embroidery on the dress.  I rather wish there was either more of the hay bale visible, or non of it - as is, it looks almost accidental.</td>', 'A pleasing wedding dress shot; the long delicate grasses match nicely with the embroidery on the dress.  I rather wish there was either more of the hay bale visible, or non of it - as is, it looks almost accidental.', '2008-08-05 15:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867037, 705377, 67258, '<td valign="top">The p-ping really suits the image.</td>', 'The p-ping really suits the image.', '2008-08-05 15:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867052, 705095, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well spotted.  I almost missed the spider - I initially saw it as part of the vegetation - just shows how well camouflaged it is! The background bokeh is good, giving a hint of the scene without being distracting, but I wish there was a little more detail in the dragon/damsel fly as it s looking a little bleached out.</td>', 'Well spotted.  I almost missed the spider - I initially saw it as part of the vegetation - just shows how well camouflaged it is! The background bokeh is good, giving a hint of the scene without being distracting, but I wish there was a little more detail in the dragon/damsel fly as it s looking a little bleached out.', '2008-08-05 15:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867054, 703073, 67258, '<td valign="top">Just goes to show that a photo without a specific subject can work!  Very well done.</td>', 'Just goes to show that a photo without a specific subject can work!  Very well done.', '2008-08-05 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867058, 704478, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very nicely observed. His pose is just perfect, and I particularly like the play of light through the windows.  I am not so keen on the star effect the light has given to the peak of the cap, but I can live with it!  I do wonder if you could ush the contrast just a little more.</td>', 'Very nicely observed. His pose is just perfect, and I particularly like the play of light through the windows.  I am not so keen on the star effect the light has given to the peak of the cap, but I can live with it!  I do wonder if you could ush the contrast just a little more.', '2008-08-05 15:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867060, 704060, 67258, '<td valign="top">Makes a change from the muscle clad young men usually pictured surfing!</td>', 'Makes a change from the muscle clad young men usually pictured surfing!', '2008-08-05 15:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867061, 702674, 67258, '<td valign="top">Weirdly effective!</td>', 'Weirdly effective!', '2008-08-05 15:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867064, 705251, 67258, '<td valign="top">awwww! Would have liked a bit more of the other side of the box too, or else neither edge, but seriously cute!</td>', 'awwww! Would have liked a bit more of the other side of the box too, or else neither edge, but seriously cute!', '2008-08-05 15:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867105, 705100, 14867, '<td valign="top">Yes, perfect. A favorite, and my fav in this challenge so far</td>', 'Yes, perfect. A favorite, and my fav in this challenge so far', '2008-08-05 16:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867106, 700132, 14867, '<td valign="top">Superb, and perfect B&amp;W;</td>', 'Superb, and perfect B&W;', '2008-08-05 16:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867108, 699153, 14867, '<td valign="top">The portrait is superb, the whole image almost: I would just clone out the distracting poster in the background.</td>', 'The portrait is superb, the whole image almost: I would just clone out the distracting poster in the background.', '2008-08-05 16:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867110, 695240, 14867, '<td valign="top">Stunning (double) portrait, the B&amp;W is superb</td>', 'Stunning (double) portrait, the B&W is superb', '2008-08-05 16:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867111, 702357, 14867, '<td valign="top">Delightful toning, classy composition, the mood is really excellent</td>', 'Delightful toning, classy composition, the mood is really excellent', '2008-08-05 16:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867112, 703286, 14867, '<td valign="top">Little masterpiece, feeling of wind indeed, poetry and excellent B&amp;W</td>', 'Little masterpiece, feeling of wind indeed, poetry and excellent B&W', '2008-08-05 16:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867113, 695356, 14867, '<td valign="top">The reflection adds still something to an excellent capture, impressive.</td>', 'The reflection adds still something to an excellent capture, impressive.', '2008-08-05 16:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867115, 704645, 14867, '<td valign="top">Impressive mood.<br/>I just would have cloned out the white dots on the water and tried to avoid teh halo above the crest (but this like trying to square the circle: DPC needs more sharpening than our monitors at home, and the sharpening produces halos !)<br/>Apart from that, great job !</td>', 'Impressive mood.I just would have cloned out the white dots on the water and tried to avoid teh halo above the crest (but this like trying to square the circle: DPC needs more sharpening than our monitors at home, and the sharpening produces halos !)Apart from that, great job !', '2008-08-05 16:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867116, 702680, 14867, '<td valign="top">Interesting work<br/>This is so clean and crisp that it''s almost surreal, the look of a CAD-image.<br/>The angle really makes the image dynamic - and original. Not obvious to get an original capture of this place. And perhaps still less obvious to get no other car in the picture !</td>', 'Interesting workThis is so clean and crisp that it''s almost surreal, the look of a CAD-image.The angle really makes the image dynamic - and original. Not obvious to get an original capture of this place. And perhaps still less obvious to get no other car in the picture !', '2008-08-05 16:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867117, 705235, 14867, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, the control of the DOF is particularly impressive. I like also the colors in a narrow warm range.</td>', 'Excellent capture, the control of the DOF is particularly impressive. I like also the colors in a narrow warm range.', '2008-08-05 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867119, 703645, 14867, '<td valign="top">Very good job, technically and artistically. Simple but amazing.</td>', 'Very good job, technically and artistically. Simple but amazing.', '2008-08-05 16:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867120, 703830, 14867, '<td valign="top">Different, very nicely done, I like a lot the way you composed this image.</td>', 'Different, very nicely done, I like a lot the way you composed this image.', '2008-08-05 16:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867121, 704786, 14867, '<td valign="top">Great. And a good title too !</td>', 'Great. And a good title too !', '2008-08-05 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867122, 704768, 14867, '<td valign="top">Simple and very good. Great sky, good use of reflection</td>', 'Simple and very good. Great sky, good use of reflection', '2008-08-05 16:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867123, 695835, 14867, '<td valign="top">Great architectural shot near abstract.<br/>The toning is excellent too.</td>', 'Great architectural shot near abstract.The toning is excellent too.', '2008-08-05 16:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867124, 697046, 14867, '<td valign="top">The deliberate choice for a very dark processing is excellent, it changes a (probably) just decent image into something strong, moody, near abstract in the sky.<br/>Not sure eveyone will appreciate, but I''m in the high-rater here</td>', 'The deliberate choice for a very dark processing is excellent, it changes a (probably) just decent image into something strong, moody, near abstract in the sky.Not sure eveyone will appreciate, but I''m in the high-rater here', '2008-08-05 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867125, 705021, 14867, '<td valign="top">Impressive quality !<br/>The background is ideal for that image.<br/>A pity that its foot is croppped, but still a very, very good capture.</td>', 'Impressive quality !The background is ideal for that image.A pity that its foot is croppped, but still a very, very good capture.', '2008-08-05 16:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867127, 704832, 14867, '<td valign="top">Superb work, a little jewel of refinement</td>', 'Superb work, a little jewel of refinement', '2008-08-05 16:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867129, 704346, 14867, '<td valign="top">Outstanding quality</td>', 'Outstanding quality', '2008-08-05 16:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867130, 702974, 14867, '<td valign="top">Brussels ?<br/>Good use of a very wide angle lens, I like the foreground globally (bench, lighting, slightwarm tone...) The sky could be a little more contrasted and/or dark IMO</td>', 'Brussels ?Good use of a very wide angle lens, I like the foreground globally (bench, lighting, slightwarm tone...) The sky could be a little more contrasted and/or dark IMO', '2008-08-05 16:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867139, 699734, 14867, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of a colored reflection and a motion blur.<br/>The processing and/or saturation of the green is a bit excessive for my taste, but still a good work.</td>', 'Very nice use of a colored reflection and a motion blur.The processing and/or saturation of the green is a bit excessive for my taste, but still a good work.', '2008-08-05 16:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867275, 704515, 57936, '<td valign="top">The canyon looks great. However, the little girl is not quite in focus and the black and white stuff in the bottom right corner is distracting. In short, I''m not sure that the idea here is that workable. It is tough to include a person in a picture with such grandiose dimensions!</td>', 'The canyon looks great. However, the little girl is not quite in focus and the black and white stuff in the bottom right corner is distracting. In short, I''m not sure that the idea here is that workable. It is tough to include a person in a picture with such grandiose dimensions!', '2008-08-05 17:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867277, 703677, 57936, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, especially on the eyes!</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, especially on the eyes!', '2008-08-05 17:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867282, 699489, 57936, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2008-08-05 17:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867289, 704478, 57936, '<td valign="top">There is a kind of hazy look in the area of his face, and the bright light on the cap is a distraction, but a nice image none-the-less.</td>', 'There is a kind of hazy look in the area of his face, and the bright light on the cap is a distraction, but a nice image none-the-less.', '2008-08-05 17:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867293, 701781, 57936, '<td valign="top">The focus on the hill is just a bit soft.</td>', 'The focus on the hill is just a bit soft.', '2008-08-05 17:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867299, 703286, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfectly titled.  Lovely sense of a summer''s day and the joy of discovery.</td>', 'Perfectly titled.  Lovely sense of a summer''s day and the joy of discovery.', '2008-08-05 17:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867300, 696507, 57936, '<td valign="top">The look on her face says: "You could have shaved for this picture!" Maybe it''s just me... The funky angle doesn''t do anything for me either.</td>', 'The look on her face says: "You could have shaved for this picture!" Maybe it''s just me... The funky angle doesn''t do anything for me either.', '2008-08-05 17:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867301, 703982, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool sky and love that striking bit of color from the window.  Impressive.</td>', 'Very cool sky and love that striking bit of color from the window.  Impressive.', '2008-08-05 17:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867308, 703830, 57936, '<td valign="top">The massive amount of blank space is excessive.</td>', 'The massive amount of blank space is excessive.', '2008-08-05 17:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867314, 701985, 57936, '<td valign="top">A little more light around the eyes would improve this, but it rocks pretty solid as is!</td>', 'A little more light around the eyes would improve this, but it rocks pretty solid as is!', '2008-08-05 17:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4867316, 697763, 57936, '<td valign="top">Too dark and the DOF is too shallow on the stem of the mushroom.</td>', 'Too dark and the DOF is too shallow on the stem of the mushroom.', '2008-08-05 17:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
