(4867345, 703942, 57936, '<td valign="top">There is a bit of what must be lens flare to the left of her head that is a distraction. The people in the background don''t seem to serve a purpose in the shot, or at least, they aren''t acting well if they are supposed to be serving a purpose. The crookedness doesn''t do anything for me, either.</td>', 'There is a bit of what must be lens flare to the left of her head that is a distraction. The people in the background don''t seem to serve a purpose in the shot, or at least, they aren''t acting well if they are supposed to be serving a purpose. The crookedness doesn''t do anything for me, either.', '2008-08-05 17:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
