(4869267, 703337, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice action catch. Especially on the NC coast.  Ya need the canes to get a good wave and then you have to know the right beach. Were you in the drink with him? Don''t see any drops so I guess not. Not bad for a long shot. Hmmmm, back to look again.  EXIF says 15mm!  You had to be in the water.<br/>Also back to bump you up to the max.  Congrats on a good action shot. (Not just because I live in NC LOL)</td>', 'Nice action catch. Especially on the NC coast.  Ya need the canes to get a good wave and then you have to know the right beach. Were you in the drink with him? Don''t see any drops so I guess not. Not bad for a long shot. Hmmmm, back to look again.  EXIF says 15mm!  You had to be in the water.Also back to bump you up to the max.  Congrats on a good action shot. (Not just because I live in NC LOL)', '2008-08-06 08:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
