(4871153, 705231, 34659, '<td valign="top">REALLY tough to find much of anything wrong with this...  Gorgeous subject, editing, composition, tones, and lighting.  Perfect catchlights.  The focus seems just a "hair" on the soft side (but this is a soft portrait, I understand).  I even like the almost plastic skin (I assume from NI or NN).  I know it sounds like I don''t like this, but it couldn''t be further from the truth...  I guess I''m trying to explain why I''m giving it a 9 instead of a 10.  :-D</td>', 'REALLY tough to find much of anything wrong with this...  Gorgeous subject, editing, composition, tones, and lighting.  Perfect catchlights.  The focus seems just a "hair" on the soft side (but this is a soft portrait, I understand).  I even like the almost plastic skin (I assume from NI or NN).  I know it sounds like I don''t like this, but it couldn''t be further from the truth...  I guess I''m trying to explain why I''m giving it a 9 instead of a 10.  :-D', '2008-08-06 18:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
