(4873121, 705184, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is way too effected and belittles the subject, which is actually interesting. More water at the bottom would aid composition mind.</td>', 'This is way too effected and belittles the subject, which is actually interesting. More water at the bottom would aid composition mind.', '2008-08-07 17:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873123, 705330, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like the vibe of this and it''s refreshing to see. Like the graphic nature and composition too and this would certainly look great at a vast size. The shards of broken image give much to the viewer to peruse. Good luck.</td>', 'Like the vibe of this and it''s refreshing to see. Like the graphic nature and composition too and this would certainly look great at a vast size. The shards of broken image give much to the viewer to peruse. Good luck.', '2008-08-07 17:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
