(4873350, 699489, 14614, '<td valign="top">having recently tried to photograph a wild fox mama and her kits, I know how tough this type of shot can be.  your timing is perfect giving this shot a comical as well as wild mood.</td>', 'having recently tried to photograph a wild fox mama and her kits, I know how tough this type of shot can be.  your timing is perfect giving this shot a comical as well as wild mood.', '2008-08-07 19:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
