(4873518, 702573, 70270, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of Librodo''s images, maybe it is.</td>', 'Looks like one of Librodo''s images, maybe it is.', '2008-08-07 20:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873519, 705018, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting this one, because on the verge of clicking a low vote. On reading the title and looking for longer I realise how deeply affecting this image is. I''m intrigued to know what you were doing here and what you may have discovered for yourself.<br/> <br/>This is one scene that would look a whole lot less impactful for some good ''golden hour'' light. The drab, depressive quality of the flat light is what makes one dwell on the events that happened there. I may have been tempted to desaturate a little further and add gravitas by boosting the contrast (which I''d do in Lab colour and mess with levels on the Lightness channel which does not affect colour).<br/> <br/>It''s actually well composed this one. Good luck.</td>', 'It''s interesting this one, because on the verge of clicking a low vote. On reading the title and looking for longer I realise how deeply affecting this image is. I''m intrigued to know what you were doing here and what you may have discovered for yourself. This is one scene that would look a whole lot less impactful for some good ''golden hour'' light. The drab, depressive quality of the flat light is what makes one dwell on the events that happened there. I may have been tempted to desaturate a little further and add gravitas by boosting the contrast (which I''d do in Lab colour and mess with levels on the Lightness channel which does not affect colour). It''s actually well composed this one. Good luck.', '2008-08-07 20:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873521, 703337, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great capture, perfect tube, this guy''s gotta be stoked to have this shot.  9</td>', 'Great capture, perfect tube, this guy''s gotta be stoked to have this shot.  9', '2008-08-07 20:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873523, 704857, 70270, '<td valign="top">Lovely forms, colors and composition.  Bumping to a 9</td>', 'Lovely forms, colors and composition.  Bumping to a 9', '2008-08-07 20:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873527, 694634, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''d have made this a more graphical composition by shooting the lines of the wall absolutely straight on, which would emphasise the starkly coloured organic lines of the flowers.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-08 08:18:37.</i></td>', 'I''d have made this a more graphical composition by shooting the lines of the wall absolutely straight on, which would emphasise the starkly coloured organic lines of the flowers.', '2008-08-07 20:48:43.000000', '2008-08-08 09:18:37.000000', 1),
(4873529, 705097, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great shot - love the drama from the light, clouds and foreground.</td>', 'Great shot - love the drama from the light, clouds and foreground.', '2008-08-07 20:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873531, 702493, 70270, '<td valign="top">Very unique image, at first it looked like one of those multiple exposures but I can see that its not.  A little to heavy on the neat image or gaussian blur for me, as you''ve lost a bit too much detail on the foreground elephant, but still very nice.  8</td>', 'Very unique image, at first it looked like one of those multiple exposures but I can see that its not.  A little to heavy on the neat image or gaussian blur for me, as you''ve lost a bit too much detail on the foreground elephant, but still very nice.  8', '2008-08-07 20:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873532, 702987, 70270, '<td valign="top">Cool sky and I like the processing.  The red door really pops here.  The fish gives an interesting perspective, but I think this one would be even better with a bit of defishing.</td>', 'Cool sky and I like the processing.  The red door really pops here.  The fish gives an interesting perspective, but I think this one would be even better with a bit of defishing.', '2008-08-07 20:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873533, 698787, 70270, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!</td>', 'Hilarious!', '2008-08-07 20:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
