(4873536, 705247, 70270, '<td valign="top">I love shallow DOF, and this image utilizes it wonderfully.</td>', 'I love shallow DOF, and this image utilizes it wonderfully.', '2008-08-07 20:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873537, 704038, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and a great find if it wasn''t a setup shot!</td>', 'Nicely composed, and a great find if it wasn''t a setup shot!', '2008-08-07 20:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873539, 701686, 17850, '<td valign="top">Very good framing and fine detail at this astrophoto!<br/>I know quite a lot of the difficulties on taking such pictures and you did really a good job here. <br/>The color of the nebulosity in most pictures of this area in Cygnus that I''ve seen, is mainly red (when imaging is done through LRGB and/or Ha) while yours is somehow different here; but noone can define how much red or pink or even purple a nebula of hudrogen should appear in a photo. So this is not a problem at all. The only thing that could possibly be better is the large blue halo around all of the bright stars, according to my humble opinion.<br/>I hope this image to get a very good score at the challenge! (9)</td>', 'Very good framing and fine detail at this astrophoto!I know quite a lot of the difficulties on taking such pictures and you did really a good job here. The color of the nebulosity in most pictures of this area in Cygnus that I''ve seen, is mainly red (when imaging is done through LRGB and/or Ha) while yours is somehow different here; but noone can define how much red or pink or even purple a nebula of hudrogen should appear in a photo. So this is not a problem at all. The only thing that could possibly be better is the large blue halo around all of the bright stars, according to my humble opinion.I hope this image to get a very good score at the challenge! (9)', '2008-08-07 20:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873541, 704233, 17850, '<td valign="top">Very nice image! (8)</td>', 'Very nice image! (8)', '2008-08-07 20:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873542, 705385, 70270, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and subtle play of greys and light, looks like a charcoal drawing.  This is why I try to go through shots at least twice when voting ... put this in the six bucket originally, now back for a second look to bump you to an 8, and I may be back again.  Ah heck, make it a 10.  Don''t see how dappled light gets much better than this.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful and subtle play of greys and light, looks like a charcoal drawing.  This is why I try to go through shots at least twice when voting ... put this in the six bucket originally, now back for a second look to bump you to an 8, and I may be back again.  Ah heck, make it a 10.  Don''t see how dappled light gets much better than this.  Good luck!', '2008-08-07 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4873546, 704285, 17850, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of this Free Study.<br/>Your portrait is simply wonderful, well done! (10)</td>', 'One of my favorites of this Free Study.Your portrait is simply wonderful, well done! (10)', '2008-08-07 20:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
