(4873552, 705322, 25678, '<td valign="top">this photo has so much potential. The lines and expression on her face make you want to sit and listen to what she will say. however, for this particular picture, the centered composition makes the pictures a bit stagnant for me. Otherwise, nicely done with the capture and tones</td>', 'this photo has so much potential. The lines and expression on her face make you want to sit and listen to what she will say. however, for this particular picture, the centered composition makes the pictures a bit stagnant for me. Otherwise, nicely done with the capture and tones', '2008-08-07 20:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
