(4873557, 705393, 25678, '<td valign="top">interesting pose and concept. However, I''m not a fan of the processing on the face. The tones of her leg I think are much more appealing then the heavy hand of noise ninja/neat image/whatever you used</td>', 'interesting pose and concept. However, I''m not a fan of the processing on the face. The tones of her leg I think are much more appealing then the heavy hand of noise ninja/neat image/whatever you used', '2008-08-07 20:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
