(4874223, 705321, 24454, '<td valign="top">Shez, your flowers are such a breath of fresh air.   And since it is winter where you are, I bet it is a source of sweet joy every time you look at this beautiful delicate flower.   The photograph is lovely!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Shez, your flowers are such a breath of fresh air.   And since it is winter where you are, I bet it is a source of sweet joy every time you look at this beautiful delicate flower.   The photograph is lovely! ', '2008-08-08 01:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
