(4874312, 703337, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  A lot of dedication goes into floating in the impact zone to get shots like this.  Looking at his clothing, I''d say it wasn''t too cold for you though.  :)  There''s a few technical issues with the shot, some aberration, looks like too much noise processing and sharpening - this is probably all from having to crop down from such a wide lens.  The drop of water covering the left side of the shot is pretty lucky it wasn''t covering the subject.  Overall still a good shot.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice shot.  A lot of dedication goes into floating in the impact zone to get shots like this.  Looking at his clothing, I''d say it wasn''t too cold for you though.  :)  There''s a few technical issues with the shot, some aberration, looks like too much noise processing and sharpening - this is probably all from having to crop down from such a wide lens.  The drop of water covering the left side of the shot is pretty lucky it wasn''t covering the subject.  Overall still a good shot.  Well done!', '2008-08-08 01:54:26.000000', NULL, 0),
