(4874315, 702472, 39430, '<td valign="top">Love it!  The essence of surfing is nicely captured in this off-da-lip shot.  The processing is quite severe, but doesn''t jump out as overdone.  Nice work.</td>', 'Love it!  The essence of surfing is nicely captured in this off-da-lip shot.  The processing is quite severe, but doesn''t jump out as overdone.  Nice work.', '2008-08-08 01:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
