(4874327, 703422, 73873, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the helpful comments. I chose quite a high compression factor for the JPG format which made it grainy, and next time I will use the full 720 pixels.<br/> <br/>Yes, it was taken in the village of Oia on Santorini...amazing views with azure sky and sea contrasting with the whitewashed walls. I couldn''t stop snapping.</td>', 'Thanks for all the helpful comments. I chose quite a high compression factor for the JPG format which made it grainy, and next time I will use the full 720 pixels. Yes, it was taken in the village of Oia on Santorini...amazing views with azure sky and sea contrasting with the whitewashed walls. I couldn''t stop snapping.', '2008-08-08 02:00:39.000000', NULL, 0),
