(4874335, 703321, 96477, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot, seemed a little over processed for my taste, oh and for what its worth, this is a Great Blue Heron and not an Egret(Egrets are actually a subgroup of the Herons), but I doubt anyone held it against you, Great Job.</td>', 'I liked this shot, seemed a little over processed for my taste, oh and for what its worth, this is a Great Blue Heron and not an Egret(Egrets are actually a subgroup of the Herons), but I doubt anyone held it against you, Great Job.', '2008-08-08 02:02:11.000000', NULL, 0),
