(4874400, 701144, 20608, '<td valign="top">6.5 is a great score Alan, I had this pegged for a better score but what do I know... congrats mate.</td>', '6.5 is a great score Alan, I had this pegged for a better score but what do I know... congrats mate.', '2008-08-08 02:40:45.000000', NULL, 0),
