(4874406, 704647, 30982, '<td valign="top">A perfect 6 - how cool is that!  And yes, you picked the right shot.  Really shows off the solemn nature of the beast well, and an excellent texture study.  Congrats on making your top row with this, too!</td>', 'A perfect 6 - how cool is that!  And yes, you picked the right shot.  Really shows off the solemn nature of the beast well, and an excellent texture study.  Congrats on making your top row with this, too!', '2008-08-08 02:46:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4874409, 702604, 39427, '<td valign="top">Classic maybe, but executed so well - you made it yours.  Ive actually wanted to take this picture for a while, I don''t know exactly where this location is, should look it up!  Man I''ve been in Philadlephia for the summer and I miss NYC so much, I love DUMBO, drinking a bottle of wine between the bridges on the water and watching the sun set over the city.  Congrats on the strong finish, great pic.</td>', 'Classic maybe, but executed so well - you made it yours.  Ive actually wanted to take this picture for a while, I don''t know exactly where this location is, should look it up!  Man I''ve been in Philadlephia for the summer and I miss NYC so much, I love DUMBO, drinking a bottle of wine between the bridges on the water and watching the sun set over the city.  Congrats on the strong finish, great pic.', '2008-08-08 02:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4874410, 695356, 34938, '<td valign="top">I am glad this ribboned Andrew, it is exceptional, congratulations...great score for a FS</td>', 'I am glad this ribboned Andrew, it is exceptional, congratulations...great score for a FS', '2008-08-08 02:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
