(4874413, 705054, 51538, '<td valign="top">HDR does not make Steve look that much better IMO.  But then again, ain''t much I like about HDR.  You''re addicted to it, man.  I used to like your photos ;-) until HDR came along.  To get back to the image, I guess those raccoon eyes are due to the excess beer...  Hope you had some fun.</td>', 'HDR does not make Steve look that much better IMO.  But then again, ain''t much I like about HDR.  You''re addicted to it, man.  I used to like your photos ;-) until HDR came along.  To get back to the image, I guess those raccoon eyes are due to the excess beer...  Hope you had some fun.', '2008-08-08 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
