(4874427, 701582, 39427, '<td valign="top">i love this shot, if it did so well in the free study I think it would have killed the still life challenge.  The tones are just right, and the white of the flowers is the perfect kick.  Simple and elegant.  Congrats on the strong finish.</td>', 'i love this shot, if it did so well in the free study I think it would have killed the still life challenge.  The tones are just right, and the white of the flowers is the perfect kick.  Simple and elegant.  Congrats on the strong finish.', '2008-08-08 02:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
