(4874605, 704065, 6771, '<td valign="top">I <b>try</b> to stay within reality and what I saw with my photos, but sometimes it is fun and interesting to step off the deep end.<br/>I did boost saturation in the yellows, blues, and magentas to get the colors to come out more from the RAW data.  Then an overall, mild saturation increase.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-08 04:09:04.</i></td>', 'I try to stay within reality and what I saw with my photos, but sometimes it is fun and interesting to step off the deep end.I did boost saturation in the yellows, blues, and magentas to get the colors to come out more from the RAW data.  Then an overall, mild saturation increase.', '2008-08-08 05:08:15.000000', '2008-08-08 05:09:04.000000', 0),
