(4874658, 705231, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top placing in a FS - very tough to do around here!  With the gorgeous models you have and your skills with lighting and direction, you should continue to do very well here!</td>', 'Congrats on the top placing in a FS - very tough to do around here!  With the gorgeous models you have and your skills with lighting and direction, you should continue to do very well here!', '2008-08-08 06:19:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4874660, 705321, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, it was you!  And I figured who better to receive the honor of my <b>20,000th</b> comment than someone who''s given so many!  This really is a lovely shot, Shez - very well exposed, and I love it as a square crop.  It did indeed jump off the page for me, too.  In a way, I think it was because it it so "you".  Thanks for sharing your wonderful view of the world around you - you truly do have a unique eye for presenting it in lovely square boxes for us!</td>', 'Ah, it was you!  And I figured who better to receive the honor of my 20,000th comment than someone who''s given so many!  This really is a lovely shot, Shez - very well exposed, and I love it as a square crop.  It did indeed jump off the page for me, too.  In a way, I think it was because it it so "you".  Thanks for sharing your wonderful view of the world around you - you truly do have a unique eye for presenting it in lovely square boxes for us!', '2008-08-08 06:23:25.000000', NULL, 0),
