(4875133, 704065, 30861, '<td valign="top">Absolutely outstanding. I''m not sure I don''t prefer the sky in the original, but that''s quibbling. Well done.</td>', 'Absolutely outstanding. I''m not sure I don''t prefer the sky in the original, but that''s quibbling. Well done.', '2008-08-08 11:03:50.000000', NULL, 0),
