(4875176, 702605, 57060, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i> I am not sure I understand your title, but, that might just be me...OK, I guess </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>the title was a joke, although had some "reality" to it. orthogonal means at a right angle or perpendicular. the boat houses allow you to go in on foot and come out on water - ie a transformation. still, just a joke.</td>', 'Originally posted by hotpasta: I am not sure I understand your title, but, that might just be me...OK, I guess   the title was a joke, although had some "reality" to it. orthogonal means at a right angle or perpendicular. the boat houses allow you to go in on foot and come out on water - ie a transformation. still, just a joke.', '2008-08-08 11:20:48.000000', NULL, 0),
