(4875211, 704159, 57060, '<td valign="top">beautiful spot, great colors, i agree with the crop comments (up just slightly) still, nice photo</td>', 'beautiful spot, great colors, i agree with the crop comments (up just slightly) still, nice photo', '2008-08-08 11:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875212, 704594, 30861, '<td valign="top">Killer nice shot. There''s a totally engaging feel to this image. I wish the front lip of the slide were muted down a bit more, is my only quibble with otherwise exceptional processing. The bright face works for me, though it might not for some.</td>', 'Killer nice shot. There''s a totally engaging feel to this image. I wish the front lip of the slide were muted down a bit more, is my only quibble with otherwise exceptional processing. The bright face works for me, though it might not for some.', '2008-08-08 11:36:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875278, 705093, 67152, '<td valign="top">Lovely softness portrayed here Cat. The colors are rich and warm. <br/> <br/>I wonder if the darkness of the edges of the shot (vignette) pulled a bit of the life of the shot out.  Also, it seems that the focus is on the single petal to the left and below the stamens, drawing our attention away from the ''mouth'' of the lily - that seems to be a very good focal point for the image.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-08 11:07:40.</i></td>', 'Lovely softness portrayed here Cat. The colors are rich and warm.  I wonder if the darkness of the edges of the shot (vignette) pulled a bit of the life of the shot out.  Also, it seems that the focus is on the single petal to the left and below the stamens, drawing our attention away from the ''mouth'' of the lily - that seems to be a very good focal point for the image.  ', '2008-08-08 12:06:56.000000', '2008-08-08 12:07:40.000000', 0),
(4875281, 702493, 60910, '<td valign="top">Wonderful wonderful should have rated higher</td>', 'Wonderful wonderful should have rated higher', '2008-08-08 12:09:08.000000', NULL, 0),
