(4875293, 695356, 66952, '<td valign="top">Really great! Both the original shot and what you''ve done with it. A well deserved ribbon. Congrats!</td>', 'Really great! Both the original shot and what you''ve done with it. A well deserved ribbon. Congrats!', '2008-08-08 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875296, 697300, 66952, '<td valign="top">Wow. A fave from me! I''ve been to those dunes several times and never got a shot like that. Just beautiful.</td>', 'Wow. A fave from me! I''ve been to those dunes several times and never got a shot like that. Just beautiful.', '2008-08-08 12:17:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875299, 703122, 66952, '<td valign="top">I knew this was yours. Excellent! You''ve got the knack with the eagles.</td>', 'I knew this was yours. Excellent! You''ve got the knack with the eagles.', '2008-08-08 12:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875301, 702974, 65083, '<td valign="top">Deb, you are NOT dull, I would be proud to hang your photo''s on my walls.</td>', 'Deb, you are NOT dull, I would be proud to hang your photo''s on my walls.', '2008-08-08 12:18:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875305, 703165, 66952, '<td valign="top">Totally excellent, Sandy! The shot is perfect. You have a way of making us see the personality of the critters, both big and small.</td>', 'Totally excellent, Sandy! The shot is perfect. You have a way of making us see the personality of the critters, both big and small.', '2008-08-08 12:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875306, 704105, 73942, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon.  This is a very dramatic image.  Very sharp and clear!</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon.  This is a very dramatic image.  Very sharp and clear!', '2008-08-08 12:20:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875310, 699734, 66952, '<td valign="top">This was one of my picks in this challenge. Beautiful stuff.</td>', 'This was one of my picks in this challenge. Beautiful stuff.', '2008-08-08 12:23:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875317, 702974, 35545, '<td valign="top">Hi Deb --  For a DPC challenge, I think you may be right about the lack of "WOW", but then a lot of the time the weather in Brussels lacks "WOW" (cold and gray), and there''s not much you can do about that!  For me, the shot sort of tails off to dark at the top.  I wonder if a more even light on the cathedral would help.  Also, did you try this in b&amp;w?  Sometimes these shots on gray days (believe me, we have plenty of them where I live, as you well know) do a lot better in b&amp;w than in color.<br/> <br/>I really like it that you caught the guy on the bench.  This becomes a very cerebral street photography shot.</td>', 'Hi Deb --  For a DPC challenge, I think you may be right about the lack of "WOW", but then a lot of the time the weather in Brussels lacks "WOW" (cold and gray), and there''s not much you can do about that!  For me, the shot sort of tails off to dark at the top.  I wonder if a more even light on the cathedral would help.  Also, did you try this in b&w?  Sometimes these shots on gray days (believe me, we have plenty of them where I live, as you well know) do a lot better in b&w than in color. I really like it that you caught the guy on the bench.  This becomes a very cerebral street photography shot.', '2008-08-08 12:30:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875330, 701130, 67585, '<td valign="top">The catch lights in the eyes really draw you in.  The whisp of hair across her face is great and works well for the composition with the lavendar in the opposing direction. Great portrait man!</td>', 'The catch lights in the eyes really draw you in.  The whisp of hair across her face is great and works well for the composition with the lavendar in the opposing direction. Great portrait man!', '2008-08-08 12:37:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4875338, 705261, 60910, '<td valign="top">it''s absolutely gorgeous and you were robbed</td>', 'it''s absolutely gorgeous and you were robbed', '2008-08-08 12:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
