(4875428, 697300, 5354, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> congratulations! I already said "beautiful", can only repeat that. In regard to earlier <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=8860" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Imagineer</a>''s comment, I definitely find Death valley much more interesting and diverse that Yosemite. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=8860" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Imagineer</a>''s comment had a smiley, so I forgive him ;-)<br/> <br/>I have to say I found DV a stronger location for photography too!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-08 12:32:36.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: congratulations! I already said "beautiful", can only repeat that. In regard to earlier  Imagineer''s comment, I definitely find Death valley much more interesting and diverse that Yosemite.    Imagineer''s comment had a smiley, so I forgive him ;-) I have to say I found DV a stronger location for photography too!', '2008-08-08 13:30:46.000000', '2008-08-08 13:32:36.000000', 0),
