(4875775, 702987, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the story that goes with this!  I also really like this shot, and oddly, for some of the reasons you detailed in your notes.  It''s like a little bubble world with a church dropped in.  Almost like one of those snow globe things without the snow in a way.  At any rate, I thought it a very cool shot.</td>', 'I love the story that goes with this!  I also really like this shot, and oddly, for some of the reasons you detailed in your notes.  It''s like a little bubble world with a church dropped in.  Almost like one of those snow globe things without the snow in a way.  At any rate, I thought it a very cool shot.', '2008-08-08 16:07:50.000000', NULL, 0),
