(4876125, 705097, 34659, '<td valign="top">Strong, dramatic, and wonderful use of natural color &amp; light.  Really a beautiful piece of work.</td>', 'Strong, dramatic, and wonderful use of natural color & light.  Really a beautiful piece of work.', '2008-08-08 20:27:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876126, 699734, 34659, '<td valign="top">Stunning use of long exposure and oversaturation.  The focus &amp; perspective/POV are just wonderful.  Nice vignetting too.  One of my top 10 picks.  Congrats on the top 20 finish.</td>', 'Stunning use of long exposure and oversaturation.  The focus & perspective/POV are just wonderful.  Nice vignetting too.  One of my top 10 picks.  Congrats on the top 20 finish.', '2008-08-08 20:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876128, 705231, 34659, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC job on the processing and presentation.  I love the skin tones &amp; texture.  Bathing Snow White is the perfect title.  Congrats on the top 20 finish - I actually had this picked for top 10.  Can''t wait to see more of your work!</td>', 'FANTASTIC job on the processing and presentation.  I love the skin tones & texture.  Bathing Snow White is the perfect title.  Congrats on the top 20 finish - I actually had this picked for top 10.  Can''t wait to see more of your work!', '2008-08-08 20:30:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876152, 695356, 28029, '<td valign="top">Magnificent! Congratulations.</td>', 'Magnificent! Congratulations.', '2008-08-08 20:58:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876153, 697396, 28029, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful- Congratulations.</td>', 'Simply beautiful- Congratulations.', '2008-08-08 20:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876154, 702974, 60862, '<td valign="top">Deb, I think this is terrific.  I much prefer this over both alternative edits.  Your composition, esp,  catching the guy, is just spot-on.<br/> <br/>Where it falls a little short for me is the sky, but even more the darkened tops of the towers.  Tone mapping can darken areas it shouldn''t, so I''d try it with two layers: tone map one, but then mask it so only the sky portion is showing, leaving the church fully bright.  That''ll help it stand out against the stormy sky.<br/> <br/>That''d also free you to darken the sky a bit.  Not a lot, and not as much as your alt. edit, but a bit. And I''d try just darkening it and increasing the contrast, not higher levels of tone mapping, to avoid the "halo" that appears near the church in the alt. edit.<br/> <br/>But all of that is to suggest minor edits to a great shot.</td>', 'Deb, I think this is terrific.  I much prefer this over both alternative edits.  Your composition, esp,  catching the guy, is just spot-on. Where it falls a little short for me is the sky, but even more the darkened tops of the towers.  Tone mapping can darken areas it shouldn''t, so I''d try it with two layers: tone map one, but then mask it so only the sky portion is showing, leaving the church fully bright.  That''ll help it stand out against the stormy sky. That''d also free you to darken the sky a bit.  Not a lot, and not as much as your alt. edit, but a bit. And I''d try just darkening it and increasing the contrast, not higher levels of tone mapping, to avoid the "halo" that appears near the church in the alt. edit. But all of that is to suggest minor edits to a great shot.', '2008-08-08 21:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4876155, 701449, 28029, '<td valign="top">Incredible portrait. Congratulations.</td>', 'Incredible portrait. Congratulations.', '2008-08-08 21:01:02.000000', NULL, 0),
