(4876456, 703073, 48228, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites in the ''July Free Study''. <br/>An excellent floral image, with awesome detail, color, textures, crop, and composition. <br/>The clarity is also excellent, and I just love the freshness, the vibrancy, the joyful look, and the exciting mood, this one gives me. <br/>Well done, on capturing an amazing fresh colorful floral image.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-08 23:56:35.</i></td>', 'This was one of my favorites in the ''July Free Study''. An excellent floral image, with awesome detail, color, textures, crop, and composition. The clarity is also excellent, and I just love the freshness, the vibrancy, the joyful look, and the exciting mood, this one gives me. Well done, on capturing an amazing fresh colorful floral image.', '2008-08-09 00:56:01.000000', '2008-08-09 00:56:35.000000', 0),
(4876462, 703379, 48228, '<td valign="top">This image captures lots of ''spirit'', action, movement, and is also quite ''emotive'' to view. <br/> <br/>A ''moment in time'' frozen, and captured for us to see.<br/> <br/>Well done Richard.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-09 00:02:50.</i></td>', 'This image captures lots of ''spirit'', action, movement, and is also quite ''emotive'' to view.  A ''moment in time'' frozen, and captured for us to see. Well done Richard.', '2008-08-09 01:01:18.000000', '2008-08-09 01:02:50.000000', 0),
(4876477, 704015, 48228, '<td valign="top"><b>EXCELLENT</b> choice for the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a> award from you Don, as I also agree with everything you have said about this image. It made me laugh, and I also love the balance of the unusual composition. <br/> <br/>The combination of the fluffy textured white clouds, against the blue sky, makes up most of the viewing picture frame, but with a mysterious cat thrown in for fun, just peeking above a stone wall. <br/> <br/><b>AWESOME.....</b>  from shez<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I had trouble deciding which photo gets which ribbon, but I finally picked this one for my blue because it is like nothing I''ve ever seen before... and it''s funny.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'EXCELLENT choice for the  posthumous award from you Don, as I also agree with everything you have said about this image. It made me laugh, and I also love the balance of the unusual composition.  The combination of the fluffy textured white clouds, against the blue sky, makes up most of the viewing picture frame, but with a mysterious cat thrown in for fun, just peeking above a stone wall.  AWESOME.....  from shez Originally posted by posthumous: I had trouble deciding which photo gets which ribbon, but I finally picked this one for my blue because it is like nothing I''ve ever seen before... and it''s funny.  ', '2008-08-09 01:10:28.000000', NULL, 0),
