(4876607, 701989, 87158, '<td valign="top">Recognized the Polish on the spot and the bills.  Krakow is a beautiful place and nice that you found this shot there.  I like the aging orange tones that come from these old posters and the framing.  I think I see a little bit of the flash reflecting on the wall as something to watch out for.</td>', 'Recognized the Polish on the spot and the bills.  Krakow is a beautiful place and nice that you found this shot there.  I like the aging orange tones that come from these old posters and the framing.  I think I see a little bit of the flash reflecting on the wall as something to watch out for.', '2008-08-09 03:34:13.000000', NULL, 0),
