(4877367, 704105, 90495, '<td valign="top">Every time I glance the thumbnail I see a claw and no, I don''t do drugs.<br/> <br/>Congrats on a superb capture. They couldn''t be any more in formation than in this shot. The parallelism is awesome. Wow, I said parallelism. I''m sure the pilots would love this shot.</td>', 'Every time I glance the thumbnail I see a claw and no, I don''t do drugs. Congrats on a superb capture. They couldn''t be any more in formation than in this shot. The parallelism is awesome. Wow, I said parallelism. I''m sure the pilots would love this shot.', '2008-08-09 17:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877383, 703165, 90495, '<td valign="top">Wow what a great shot you captured. I can''t get within 20 ft of these buggers. Congrats on the top 10 finish.</td>', 'Wow what a great shot you captured. I can''t get within 20 ft of these buggers. Congrats on the top 10 finish.', '2008-08-09 17:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877410, 704143, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is underrated.  In reading the incredibly deep dramatic commentary others saw in this photo, my comment that it was a "fun odd sort of shot" seems out of place now!  : )  Before having my perspective changed by the comments of others, the pic just felt like a moment of recess /enjoyment - a boy taking a break from somthing dull &amp; just being a boy.  Well, either way, it''s a good shot!</td>', 'This is underrated.  In reading the incredibly deep dramatic commentary others saw in this photo, my comment that it was a "fun odd sort of shot" seems out of place now!  : )  Before having my perspective changed by the comments of others, the pic just felt like a moment of recess /enjoyment - a boy taking a break from somthing dull & just being a boy.  Well, either way, it''s a good shot!', '2008-08-09 18:02:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877463, 704105, 82503, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shot! Congratulations, Robert! I like the outtakes, too, especially the colorful third one!</td>', 'Fascinating shot! Congratulations, Robert! I like the outtakes, too, especially the colorful third one!', '2008-08-09 19:08:23.000000', NULL, 0),
