(4877478, 705345, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''d leave a comment if I knew what to say. I have come back to this time and again, and can''t think of the right words. The picture is haunting.</td>', 'I''d leave a comment if I knew what to say. I have come back to this time and again, and can''t think of the right words. The picture is haunting.', '2008-08-09 19:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
