(4877559, 704065, 75532, '<td valign="top">This shot inspires me to go out there and try to find all the possibilities around me.  I looked around in your portfolio and you have some great images!</td>', 'This shot inspires me to go out there and try to find all the possibilities around me.  I looked around in your portfolio and you have some great images!', '2008-08-09 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877597, 704105, 41794, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back and looking at this over and over again. It just takes my breath away. Absolutely amazing photo and most well deserving of a blue ribbon.</td>', 'I keep coming back and looking at this over and over again. It just takes my breath away. Absolutely amazing photo and most well deserving of a blue ribbon.', '2008-08-09 21:26:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877603, 698751, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice shot with good lighting on the tracks. I think the biggest reason it came in almost a dead 5 was that it is a subject and a view that has been done many times before, and this one was good, but not really different from the rest of them. I had a similar outtake that I really liked for the "sepia" challenge, but I decided it was an overdone subject.<br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/yospiff/2452920407/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm3.static.flickr.com/2139/2452920407_586d743f03_t.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm3.static.flickr.com/2139/2452920407_586d743f03_t.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm3.static.flickr.com/2139/2452920407_586d743f03_t.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>On the other hand, many challenges are won by people <strike>duplicating</strike> being inspired by previous winners, so what do I know?</td>', 'A nice shot with good lighting on the tracks. I think the biggest reason it came in almost a dead 5 was that it is a subject and a view that has been done many times before, and this one was good, but not really different from the rest of them. I had a similar outtake that I really liked for the "sepia" challenge, but I decided it was an overdone subject.  On the other hand, many challenges are won by people duplicating being inspired by previous winners, so what do I know?', '2008-08-09 21:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877625, 695356, 82749, '<td valign="top">Andrew, this is awesome!!!  WTG, and congrats on the red!</td>', 'Andrew, this is awesome!!!  WTG, and congrats on the red!', '2008-08-09 21:50:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877626, 704105, 82749, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!!!  Really powerful image.  Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'This is awesome!!!  Really powerful image.  Congrats on the blue!', '2008-08-09 21:51:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877658, 695729, 50695, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, but I do not have to eat my hat.</td>', 'Cute shot, but I do not have to eat my hat.', '2008-08-09 22:46:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877667, 701530, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I DEFINITELY see the beauty in this photo!   I LOVE industrial photos like this so much.  I pass a cement factory on my way home from work, and every day, I think about stopping, or coming back when it is lit up to take photos of it.   This one is particularly beautiful because it is sunset, and there is still plenty of detail in the silhouette.<br/> <br/>I really don''t understand the 5.1!   You got so robbed :(   I hate it when that happens.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, I DEFINITELY see the beauty in this photo!   I LOVE industrial photos like this so much.  I pass a cement factory on my way home from work, and every day, I think about stopping, or coming back when it is lit up to take photos of it.   This one is particularly beautiful because it is sunset, and there is still plenty of detail in the silhouette. I really don''t understand the 5.1!   You got so robbed :(   I hate it when that happens. ', '2008-08-09 22:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877675, 704788, 51747, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who viewed, voted and commented on my entry in the free study challenge. All of your comments were very constructive and I appreciate you taking the time to comment. This was my first challenge entered. I was happy with the overall score as I had hoped to get at least a 5. I was pleasantly surprised that I received 59 votes over 5 and a little disappointed that I got 10 votes under 4. So it goes. Perhaps a different title such as '' DOF '' might have made a difference. Some people ''got it'' and others didn''t. I will learn as I go.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-10 21:56:15.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all who viewed, voted and commented on my entry in the free study challenge. All of your comments were very constructive and I appreciate you taking the time to comment. This was my first challenge entered. I was happy with the overall score as I had hoped to get at least a 5. I was pleasantly surprised that I received 59 votes over 5 and a little disappointed that I got 10 votes under 4. So it goes. Perhaps a different title such as '' DOF '' might have made a difference. Some people ''got it'' and others didn''t. I will learn as I go.', '2008-08-09 23:00:26.000000', '2008-08-10 22:56:15.000000', 0),
(4877688, 703286, 51747, '<td valign="top">A timeless photo Judy. VERY nicely presented. Congrats on your top 20 Finish !!</td>', 'A timeless photo Judy. VERY nicely presented. Congrats on your top 20 Finish !!', '2008-08-09 23:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4877950, 705093, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at images outside of DPC, and this seems like one people would pay to hang on their walls.  Don''t change a thing. :)</td>', 'I''ve been looking at images outside of DPC, and this seems like one people would pay to hang on their walls.  Don''t change a thing. :)', '2008-08-10 03:15:10.000000', NULL, 0);
