(4878369, 695321, 4493, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I narrowed my browser and ''cropped'' the woman on the left out and it becomes a much stronger shot with just the guy. Crop from her finger tips to the left out, and then a crop a hair on the right so to center the man, and you''ll have a great print!<br/> <br/>Good work!<br/> <br/>-danny</td>', 'This is a great shot. I narrowed my browser and ''cropped'' the woman on the left out and it becomes a much stronger shot with just the guy. Crop from her finger tips to the left out, and then a crop a hair on the right so to center the man, and you''ll have a great print! Good work! -danny', '2008-08-10 12:26:27.000000', NULL, 0),
