(4878833, 703073, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your lumy nomination. My Sunflower Wishes image has a story. Every year, Buttonwood Farm in Griswold, CT. grows 10-15 acres of sunflowers. For one week in July, they have a fundraiser called Sunflowers For Wishes. They sell bouquets of the sunflowers (my image is a bunch of bouquets ready for sale) and send all proceeds to the Make A Wish Foundation. The foundation grants final wishes for terminally ill children. Last year they raised over $75,000. This year they will most likely top that because they were highlighted in a national magazine, Yankee. I have never seen so many sunflowers, so I had to enter it. Thanks again for the nomination.</td>', 'Thanks for your lumy nomination. My Sunflower Wishes image has a story. Every year, Buttonwood Farm in Griswold, CT. grows 10-15 acres of sunflowers. For one week in July, they have a fundraiser called Sunflowers For Wishes. They sell bouquets of the sunflowers (my image is a bunch of bouquets ready for sale) and send all proceeds to the Make A Wish Foundation. The foundation grants final wishes for terminally ill children. Last year they raised over $75,000. This year they will most likely top that because they were highlighted in a national magazine, Yankee. I have never seen so many sunflowers, so I had to enter it. Thanks again for the nomination.', '2008-08-10 20:32:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4878859, 695729, 67723, '<td valign="top">just curious, was this processed with Essential HDR? Cool shot by the way.</td>', 'just curious, was this processed with Essential HDR? Cool shot by the way.', '2008-08-10 21:06:45.000000', NULL, 0),
