(4888289, 698064, 3020, '<td valign="top">I see no one has commented on this photo since voting ended, which is sad. I like the image, I agree that the hands shouldn''t be cut off however I feel the OOF block to the left adds a nice depth to the image. I do not believe the image if cropped would have the same impact to me. Perhaps another angle to have taken this image would be to crop and decrease the depth of field to keep the remaining foreground OOF but I''m not sure the smaller block is far enough from her not to also catch her in the blur.</td>', 'I see no one has commented on this photo since voting ended, which is sad. I like the image, I agree that the hands shouldn''t be cut off however I feel the OOF block to the left adds a nice depth to the image. I do not believe the image if cropped would have the same impact to me. Perhaps another angle to have taken this image would be to crop and decrease the depth of field to keep the remaining foreground OOF but I''m not sure the smaller block is far enough from her not to also catch her in the blur.', '2008-08-14 10:40:25.000000', NULL, 0),
