(4901162, 703165, 68035, '<td valign="top">At a time when I feel mightily disgruntled with DPC (note to self is it possible to feel gruntled about anything) it is images like this and talent like yours that keeps me coming back for one more look<br/> <br/>The colour and sharpness of this shot is beyond praise.  I know you felt that you were struggling with your new lens (even when you were producing great shots)  but this is simply awesome.<br/> <br/>One of very few pictures I would actually pay good money to purchase<br/> <br/>Sandy my admiration for you as a photographer and a person knows no bounds</td>', 'At a time when I feel mightily disgruntled with DPC (note to self is it possible to feel gruntled about anything) it is images like this and talent like yours that keeps me coming back for one more look The colour and sharpness of this shot is beyond praise.  I know you felt that you were struggling with your new lens (even when you were producing great shots)  but this is simply awesome. One of very few pictures I would actually pay good money to purchase Sandy my admiration for you as a photographer and a person knows no bounds', '2008-08-20 20:29:36.000000', NULL, 0),
