(4913739, 702472, 60862, '<td valign="top">ROFL.  After our recent exchange about purple, look at the comments I find from you on this shot. :)<br/> <br/>This is GORGEOUS.  I mean, the color is sooooo rich.  I haven''t really figured out how to shoot or process shots with this kind of tint.  But you also have such a wonderful mix of sharpness and motion blur.  Congrats on top 25 in a FS!</td>', 'ROFL.  After our recent exchange about purple, look at the comments I find from you on this shot. :) This is GORGEOUS.  I mean, the color is sooooo rich.  I haven''t really figured out how to shoot or process shots with this kind of tint.  But you also have such a wonderful mix of sharpness and motion blur.  Congrats on top 25 in a FS!', '2008-08-27 01:44:42.000000', NULL, 0),
