(4916145, 703474, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of the things I still like about DPC (other than the comraderie) is how different people see the same picture differently.  The people, both the two on the wall and the ones off to the right, are what gives life to this picture, and I really like the handbags on the ground.  To me that creates a sense of peace and comfortableness - they can sit and talk with their bags there and not worry.  A nice quiet evening enjoyed.</td>', 'One of the things I still like about DPC (other than the comraderie) is how different people see the same picture differently.  The people, both the two on the wall and the ones off to the right, are what gives life to this picture, and I really like the handbags on the ground.  To me that creates a sense of peace and comfortableness - they can sit and talk with their bags there and not worry.  A nice quiet evening enjoyed.', '2008-08-27 19:14:52.000000', NULL, 0),
