(4921936, 702737, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey steve .. i dont know why but this shot makes me laugh .. it could be the way the eyes are repeated by the flowers ... not the same exact shape or colour .. but like .. kapow .. !! .. and his cool expression of course .. !! .. a very laid back and relaxed frog .. :)<br/></td>', 'hey steve .. i dont know why but this shot makes me laugh .. it could be the way the eyes are repeated by the flowers ... not the same exact shape or colour .. but like .. kapow .. !! .. and his cool expression of course .. !! .. a very laid back and relaxed frog .. :)', '2008-08-30 18:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
