(4922215, 703059, 58272, '<td valign="top">I really don''t mind the angle here so much, it adds interest to the shot. There does appear to be some noise which I gather might have been created during processing if this was shot at ISO 80?<br/>I don''t mind the noise here either but I guess it''s not to everyone''s tastes, this looks like a perfect candidate for "grunge/overlay" processing if you wanted to disguise it....<br/>I''m not too sure about the colour of the man''s skin, it looks a bit blotchy. <br/>Overall, for something shot from the hip I''d say job well done!</td>', 'I really don''t mind the angle here so much, it adds interest to the shot. There does appear to be some noise which I gather might have been created during processing if this was shot at ISO 80?I don''t mind the noise here either but I guess it''s not to everyone''s tastes, this looks like a perfect candidate for "grunge/overlay" processing if you wanted to disguise it....I''m not too sure about the colour of the man''s skin, it looks a bit blotchy. Overall, for something shot from the hip I''d say job well done!', '2008-08-30 22:07:47.000000', NULL, 0),
